readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	DLLA1	DLLA1			0	hr	If you perform an administrative installation using setup /a, you need to make sure that the file msvcr100.dll is installed on the system. This file is required for ${PRODUCTNAME} to start after an administrative installation. You can get the file from <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-US/download/details.aspx?id=26999">https://www.microsoft.com/en-US/download/details.aspx?id=26999</a>				20181231 09:50:43
