helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	hr	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EE				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FE				0	hr	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20181231 09:50:43
