helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143269				0	hr	Have a look at \<link href=\"http://www.dmaths.org\"\>www.dmaths.org\</link\> for a set of additional %PRODUCTNAME Math icons and macros.				20181231 09:50:43
