helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149185				0	hr	DIM text$(5 to 25)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149690				0	hr	21 element numeriran od 5 do 25				20181231 09:50:43
