helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153113				0	hr	21 element (uključujući 0), numeriran od -15 do 5				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153005				0	hr	The index range can include positive as well as negative numbers. 				20181231 09:50:43
