helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145640				0	hr	Select to where you want to append the library in the \<emph\>Location\</emph\> list. If you select %PRODUCTNAME Macros & Dialogs, the library will belong to the $[officename] application and will be available for all documents. If you select a document the library will be appended to this document and only available from there.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Append\</emph\> and select an external library to append.				20181231 09:50:43
