helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	hr	Exits the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> procedure immediately. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> call.				20181231 09:50:43
