helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	hr	Prikazuje kursor u dijalogu u koji korisnik može unijeti tekst. Ulaz se pridružuje varijabli.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	hr	The \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> statement is a convenient method of entering text through a dialog. Confirm the input by clicking OK or pressing Return. The input is returned as the function return value. If you close the dialog with Cancel, \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> returns a zero-length string ("").				20181231 09:50:43
