helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156042				0	hr	Konvertira broj u znakovni niz, a tada ga formatira u skladu s navedenim formatom.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145090				0	hr	Syntax:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	hr	Format (Number [, Format As String])				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149178				0	hr	Return value:				20181231 09:50:43
