helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	hr	The \<emph\>Choose\</emph\> function returns a value from the list of expressions based on the index value. If Index = 1, the function returns the first expression in the list, if index i= 2, it returns the second expression, and so on.				20181231 09:50:43
