helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	hr	Method of the com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener interface				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	hr	U ovom primjeru, prefix je ConstListener_. Zato sljedeći podprogram mora biti ugrađen u Basic.				20181231 09:50:43
