helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090407.xhp	0	help	par_id6187017				0	hr	You can use a space followed by the underline character _ as the last two characters of a line to continue the logical line on the next line. To continue comment lines, you must enter "Option Compatible" in the same Basic module.				20181231 09:50:43
