helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafRed\"\>Specifies the amount of red RGB color components for the selected graphic object.\</ahelp\> Values from -100% (no red) to +100% (full red) are possible.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	hr	\<image id=\"img_id3146130\" src=\"res/sc10865.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146130\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
