helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147230				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Rect\"\>Draws a rectangle where you drag in the current document. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153367				0	hr	Elipsa				20181231 09:50:43
