helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388				0	hr	INSRT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	hr	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	hr	OVER				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	hr	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				20181231 09:50:43
