helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	hr	Set left indent				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	hr	Drag the bottom left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				20181231 09:50:43
