helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151315				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Reload\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Replaces the current document with the last saved version.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
