helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E5				0	hr	Content of table fields in the columns of a table control				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E9				0	hr	Graphics or text that are used in buttons				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN109EC				0	hr	The \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> option for buttons is called \<emph\>Graphics alignment\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153141				0	hr	Vertical Alignment				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151394				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_VERTICAL_ALIGN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the vertical alignment for text or graphics content which used on a control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151073				0	hr	SamoIspuna				20181231 09:50:43
