helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id6092715				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_REPEAT_DELAY\"\>Specifies the delay in milliseconds between repeating events.\</ahelp\> A repeating event occurs when you click an arrow button or the background of a scrollbar, or one of the record navigation buttons of a Navigation Bar, and you keep the mouse button pressed for some time. You can enter a value followed by a valid time unit, for example, 2 s or 500 ms.				20181231 09:50:43
