helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740	199			0	hr	For a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Reset type\"\>Reset type\</link\> button, the\<emph\> Default value entry \</emph\>defines the status of the control if the reset button is activated by the user.				20181231 09:50:43
