helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155262				0	hr	Uobičajeno				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	hr	The view of the graphic object is not changed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	hr	Sivi tonovi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	hr	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also achieve tinted grayscale colors by raising one of the color parameters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	hr	Crno i bijelo				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	hr	The graphic object is shown in black and white. All brightness values below 50% will appear black, all over 50% will appear white.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	hr	Vodeni žig				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	hr	The graphic object is raised in brightness and reduced in contrast so that it can be used in the background as a watermark. 				20181231 09:50:43
