helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	hr	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_SEARCH\"\>Click and choose one of the Internet search engines from the submenu. The search term is entered in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> The list of search engines in the \<emph\>Find \</emph\>submenu is defined in \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Internet - Search\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Internet - Search\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
