helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	hr	The table view and form view reflect the same data. Changes made in the table are also visible in the form, and changes to the form are visible in the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	hr	If there are several logical forms in a document, the table is only able to show one at a time.				20181231 09:50:43
