helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	hr	\<variable id=\"suchentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RecSearch\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches database tables and forms.\</ahelp\>In forms or database tables, you can search through data fields, list boxes, and check boxes for specific values. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	hr	When searching a table, the data fields of the current table are searched. When searching in a form, the data fields of the table linked with the form are searched.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	hr	The search described here is carried out by \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>. If you want to use the SQL server to search in a database, then you should use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"Form-based Filters\"\>Form-based Filters\</link\> icon on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Bar\"\>Form Bar\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	hr	The search function is also available for table controls. When calling the search function from a table control, you can search each column of the table control corresponding to the database columns of the linked database table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	hr	Traži				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	hr	Specifies the type of search.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153683				0	hr	Tekst:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_SEARCHFORM_RB_SEARCHFORTEXT\"\>Enter the search term in the box or select it from the list.\</ahelp\> The text under the cursor is already copied into the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> combo box. Note that while running a search in a form, tabs and line breaks cannot be processed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	hr	Your search terms will be saved as long as the table or the formula document is open. If you are running more than one search and you would like to repeat the search term, you can select a previously used search term from the combo box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153662				0	hr	Field content is NULL				20181231 09:50:43
