helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B65				0	hr	\<image id=\"img_id6128727\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_usewizards.png\" width=\"0.2228inch\" height=\"0.2228inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6128727\"\>wizards on off control\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B76				0	hr	Turns on and turns off the automatic form controls wizards.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id6403088				0	hr	These wizards help you to enter the properties of list boxes, table controls, and other controls.				20181231 09:50:43
