helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A75				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpinButton\"\>Creates a spin button.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id710776				0	hr	If you add a spin button to a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between the spin button and a cell. As a result, when you change the contents of a cell, the contents of the spin button are updated. Conversely, if you change the value of the spin button, the contents of the cell are updated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ABC				0	hr	Klizač				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ACA				0	hr	\<image id=\"img_id8203985\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_scrollbar.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id8203985\"\>scrollbar control\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ADB				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ScrollBar\"\>Creates a scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CA3				0	hr	You can specify the following properties for a scrollbar:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CDA				0	hr	UI name				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE0				0	hr	Semantics				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	hr	Scroll value min				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	hr	Specifies the minimum height or the minimum width of a scrollbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	hr	Scroll value max				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	hr	Specifies the maximum height or the maximum width of a scrollbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	hr	Uobičajena vrijednost pomicanja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	hr	Specifies the default value of a scrollbar, used when the form is reset.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	hr	Usmjerenje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	hr	Specifies the orientation of a scrollbar, that is, horizontal or vertical.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	hr	Mala izmjena				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	hr	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	hr	Velika izmjena				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	hr	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	hr	Zadrška				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	hr	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	hr	Znak boje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	hr	Specifies the color of the arrows on the scrollbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	hr	Visible Size				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	hr	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	hr	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	hr	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				20181231 09:50:43
