helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				20181231 09:50:43
