helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hr	\<variable id=\"kontroll\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlProperties\"\>Opens a dialog for editing the properties of a selected control.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157910	17			0	hr	\<variable id=\"hinweis\"\>You can only call the\<emph\> Properties\</emph\> dialog when in the Design mode with a control selected. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	hr	If you enter data in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog, note that multiline input is possible for certain drop-down combo boxes. This concerns all fields in which an SQL statement can be entered, as well as the properties of text boxes or label fields. You can open these fields and enter text in the opened list. The following shortcut keys are valid:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686				0	hr	Tipke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	hr	Efekti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	hr	Alt+Down Arrow				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150944				0	hr	Opens the combo box				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153627				0	hr	Alt+Up Arrow				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063				0	hr	Closes the combo box				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	hr	Shift+Enter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	hr	Inserts a new line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	hr	Strelica gore				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	hr	Places the cursor into the previous line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	hr	Strelica dolje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	hr	Places the cursor into the next line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	hr	Unos				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	hr	Completes the input in the field and places the cursor into the next field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	hr	As with list boxes or combo boxes, you can open or close the list with a mouse click at the arrow on the right end of the field. However, the input here can be entered either in the opened list or in the top text field. An exception is the properties that expect a list representation, for example, the property \<emph\>List Entries\</emph\>, which can be set for the control fields \<emph\>List Box\</emph\> and \<emph\>Combo Box\</emph\>. Here, you can only edit the entries when the field is opened.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170901.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\"\>Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	hr	Specifies a table from the available database tables that contains the data field whose content should be displayed as a list entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	hr	For list boxes, a table that can be linked with the current form table is indicated. The link table must have at least one field in common with the table of the current form. This makes it possible to establish an unambiguous reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	hr	For combo boxes, there must be a relationship between the form table and the table containing the data to be displayed in the combo box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	hr	Tablica				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338	7			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_CONTENTSELECTION_TABLE_LB_SELECTTABLE\"\>In the\<emph\> Table \</emph\>field, select the table containing the data field whose content should be displayed in the control field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	hr	The table given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
