helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_URL\"\>Allows you to either type a URL, or insert a URL from a document using drag-and-drop.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894				0	hr	You can edit the URL and insert it at the current cursor position in the active document with the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon. The \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon can only be activated if the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field contains text.				20181231 09:50:43
