helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	hr	You can make additional adjustments to the spacing by selecting \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\"\>\<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Općenito				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152551				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>submitting forms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>get method for form transmissions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>post method for form transmissions\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>General\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	hr	A form is a text document or spreadsheet with different form controls. If you create a form for a Web page, the user can enter data into it to send over the Internet. The data from the form controls of a form is transmitted to a server by specifying a URL and can be processed on the server.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149283				0	hr	Ime				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	hr	Specifies a name for the form. This name is used to identify the form in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152425				0	hr	URL				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	hr	Specifies the URL to which the data of the completed form is to be transmitted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154751				0	hr	Okvir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	hr	Defines the target frame in which the loaded URL is to appear.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	hr	Tip podneska				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_METHOD\"\>Specifies the method to transfer the completed form information.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145065				0	hr	Using the "Get" method, the data of every control is transmitted as an environment variable. They are appended to the URL in the form "?Control1=Content1&Control2=Content2&..."; the character string is analyzed by a program on the recipient's server.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	hr	Using the "Post" method, a document is created from the content of the form that is sent to the specified URL.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	hr	Kod slanja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_ENCODING\"\>Specifies the type for encoding the data transfer.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	hr	Data transfer of control information				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	hr	When sending a form, all controls available in $[officename] are taken into consideration. The name of the control and the corresponding value, if available, are transmitted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	hr	Which values are transmitted in each case depends on the respective control. For text fields, the visible entries are transmitted; for list boxes, the selected entries are transmitted; for check boxes and option fields, the associated reference values are transmitted if these fields were activated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	hr	How this information is transmitted depends on the selected transfer method (Get or Post) and the coding (URL or Multipart). If the Get method and URL encoding are selected, for example, value pairs in the form <Name>=<Value> are sent.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	hr	In addition to the controls that are recognized in HTML, $[officename] offers other controls. It should be noted that, for fields with a specific numerical format, the visible values are not transmitted but rather fixed default formats. The following table shows how the data of the $[officename]-specific controls is transmitted:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	hr	Kontrola				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	hr	Value Pair				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	hr	Numeric field, currency field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734				0	hr	A decimal separator is always displayed as a period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	hr	Date field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	hr	The date format is sent in a fixed format (MM-DD-YYYY), regardless of the user's local settings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	hr	Time field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153779				0	hr	The time format is sent in a fixed format (HH:MM:SS), regardless of the user's local settings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	hr	Pattern field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	hr	The values of pattern fields are sent as text fields, that is, the value visible in the form is sent.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	hr	Table control				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	hr	From the table control, the individual columns are always transmitted. The name of the control, the name of the column, and the value of the column are sent. Using the Get method with URL encoding, the transmission is done in the form <Name of the table control>.<Name of the column>=<Value>, for example, with the value being dependent on the column.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Pošta i interesne grupe				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147102				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070200.xhp\" name=\"Mail News\"\>Mail & News\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	hr	On the \<emph\>Mail & News\</emph\> page in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> you can edit hyperlinks for e-mail or news addresses.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153528				0	hr	Pošta i interesne grupe				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153748				0	hr	E-pošta				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	hr	Novosti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_NEWS\"\>Assigns a news address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the hyperlink in the document will open a new message document to the news group you entered in the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149580				0	hr	Primatelj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERDLG_MAIL_PATH\"\>Specifies the full URL of the addressee, in the form mailto:name@provider.com or news:group.server.com.\</ahelp\> You can also use drag-and-drop.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	hr	Izvori podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_IMAGEBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_BTN_ADRESSBOOK\"\>Hides or shows the data source browser.\</ahelp\> Drag the receiver's \<emph\>Email\</emph\> data field from the data source browser into the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> text field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153332				0	hr	Subjekt				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153821				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_ED_SUBJECT\"\>Specifies the subject that is inserted in the subject line of the new message document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Primijeni stil				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148520				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/02010000.xhp\" name=\"Apply Style\"\>Apply Style\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StyleApply\"\>Assigns a style to the current paragraph, selected paragraphs, or to a selected object.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	hr	To reset the selected objects to the default paragraph style , select \<item type=\"literal\"\>Clear formatting\</item\>. Select \<item type=\"literal\"\>More\</item\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	hr	\<image id=\"img_id3152801\" src=\"res/helpimg/zellvor.png\" width=\"1.528in\" height=\"0.292in\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152801\"\>Apply Style\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hr	Primijeni stil				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149991				0	hr	Polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149987				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>database contents; inserting as fields\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149987	8			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_RADIOBUTTON_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_RB_AS_FIELD\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as fields.\</ahelp\>In the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, select the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>Fields\</link\> to insert the selected data into the document as fields. These \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090006.xhp\" name=\"database fields\"\>database fields\</link\> work as wildcards for the individual database columns and can be used for form letters. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12080000.xhp\" name=\"Data to Fields\"\>\<emph\>Data to Fields\</emph\>\</link\> icon to match the contents of the fields to the currently selected record.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	hr	If several records are selected when you choose the \<emph\>Data to Text\</emph\> function, the mail merge fields will be inserted according to the number of records. Also, a field command such as "Next record" will be inserted automatically between individual field command blocks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	hr	The \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog lets you define which database fields to insert into the document and how to format the paragraphs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	hr	Polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> area, use the arrow button to select the database table columns into which you want to insert field contents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	hr	Stupci baze podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	hr	Lists all columns of the database table, which can be accepted in the selection list box to insert them into the document. \<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_LB_TXT_DB_COLUMN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select the database columns that you want to insert it in the document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	hr	>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hr	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_IB_DBCOL_TOEDIT\"\>Moves the fields that you selected in the \<emph\>Database columns\</emph\> list box into the selection field.\</ahelp\> You can also double-click the entry to select it.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166411				0	hr	Odabir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MULTILINEEDIT_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_ED_DB_TEXT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Lists the database columns that you selected to be inserted into the document. You can also enter text here. This text will be also inserted into the document.\</ahelp\> The entries' order in the selection field corresponds to the data order in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153257				0	hr	Stil odlomka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	hr	By default, the inserted paragraphs are formatted with the current Paragraph Styles. This format corresponds to the "none" entry in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> list box. \<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_LB_DB_PARA_COLL\" visibility=\"visible\"\>This is where you can select other Paragraph Styles to apply to the paragraph you want to insert into the document.\</ahelp\> The list box displays the available Paragraph Styles defined in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> and managed in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"Style Catalog\"\>Style Catalog\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Zatvori				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152895				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/10100000.xhp\" name=\"Close\"\>Close\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CloseWin\"\>Closes the current window.\</ahelp\> Choose \<emph\>Window - Close\</emph\>, or press Ctrl+F4. In the page preview of $[officename] Writer and Calc, you can close the current window by clicking the \<emph\>Close Preview\</emph\> button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143				0	hr	If additional views of the current document were opened by \<emph\>Window - New Window\</emph\>, this command will close only the current view.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Close the current document\"\>Close the current document\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Combo Box Wizard: Database Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144740				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170904.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\"\>Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	hr	With the combination fields, you can either save the value of a field in a database or display this value in a form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	hr	The user values entered in the combination field or selected in the list can be saved in the database table that is accessed in the form. Note that the saving of values in another table is not possible. If the values are not to be saved in a database, they will be saved only in the form. This is especially helpful in HTML forms, where the user's entered or selected values are to be assigned to a server.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149760				0	hr	Želite li spremiti vrijednost u polje baze podataka?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	hr	Two options are available for this question:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153394				0	hr	Yes, I want to save it in the following database field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies whether the user's entered or selected combination field value should be saved in a database field.\</ahelp\> Several database table fields are offered which can be accessed in the current form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3145212				0	hr	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\> the selected field appears as an entry in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page under \<emph\>Data field\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149177				0	hr	List field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_LB_STOREINFIELD\"\>Specifies the data field where the combination field value should be saved.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	hr	No, I only want to save the value in the form				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_NO\"\>Specifies that the value of this combination field will not be written in the database and will only be saved in the form.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Hiperveza				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154094				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09030000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink\"\>Hyperlink\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100	2			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetHyperlink\"\>Inserts a hyperlink from the current URL into your document.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> address is taken from the entry in the \<emph\>Internet URLs \</emph\>combo box, and the name of the link is taken from the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> combo box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	3			0	hr	You can insert the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#hyperlink\" name=\"hyperlink\"\>hyperlink\</link\> as text or as a button. Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> icon, then select \<emph\>As text\</emph\> or \<emph\>As button \</emph\>from the menu. The hyperlink is then inserted at the current cursor location.				20181231 09:50:43
