helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN10F3E				0	hr	If entered value is TRUE or not 0: Check box is selected\<br/\>If entered value is FALSE or 0: Check box is deselected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN10F47				0	hr	Clear the linked cell, or enter text, or enter a formula that returns text or an error				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN10F4D				0	hr	Check box is set to "undetermined" state if it is a tri-state check box, else check box is deselected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11023				0	hr	Select the box. The Reference value box contains text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1103A				0	hr	The text from the Reference value box is copied to the cell.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11040				0	hr	Deselect the box. The Reference value box contains text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11008				0	hr	An empty string is copied to the cell.				20181231 09:50:43
