helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	hr	The following comparative operators can be set under \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Default Filter\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
