helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148643				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>controls; events\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>events; controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>macros; assigning to events in forms\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	hr	On the\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page you can link macros to events that occur in a form's control fields.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	hr	When the event occurs, the linked macro will be called. To assign a macro to an event, press the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>dialog\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	hr	Depending on the control, different events are available. Only the available events for the selected control and context are listed on the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab page. The following events are defined:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191				0	hr	Prije početka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example,clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Before commencing\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	hr	Kada inicijalizira				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The\<emph\> When initiating \</emph\>event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343				0	hr	Promijenjeno				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Changed \</emph\>event takes place when the control loses the focus and the content of the control has changed since it lost the focus.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	hr	Tekst promijenjen				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Text modified \</emph\>event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	hr	Promijenjen status stavke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Item status changed \</emph\>event takes place if the status of the control field has changed.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Item status changed\</emph\> event takes place if he status of the control field has changed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	hr	Kada prima fokus				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	17			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSGAINED\"\>The\<emph\> When receiving focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field receives the focus.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	hr	Kada gubi fokus				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	19			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>The\<emph\> When losing focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field looses the focus.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287				0	hr	Pritisnuta tipka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	21			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>The \<emph\>Key pressed \</emph\>event occurs when the user presses any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\> This event may be linked to a macro for checking entries.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154127				0	hr	Tipka otpuštena				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150	44			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYUP\"\>The\<emph\> Key release \</emph\>event occurs when the user releases any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154921				0	hr	Miš unutra				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse inside \</emph\>event takes place if the mouse is inside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	hr	Miš pomaknut dok je tipka bila pritisnuta				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	31			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved while key pressed \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed at the same time.\</ahelp\> An example is when, during drag-and-drop, an additional key determines the mode (move or copy).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	hr	Miš pomaknut				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	33			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse moves over the control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197				0	hr	Gumb miša pritisnut				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	23			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEPRESSED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button pressed \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is pressed while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	hr	Note that this event is also used for notifying requests for a popup context menu on the control. If you are using this event by a program macro, you find more information in the "StarOffice 8 Programming Guide for BASIC".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	hr	Gumb miša otpušten				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659	25			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button released \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is released while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286				0	hr	Miš izvan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	29			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEEXITED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse outside \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is outside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
