helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	hr	To apply highlighting to a single word, double-click the word.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10757				0	hr	To turn off highlighting, press Esc.				20181231 09:50:43
