helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_idN10632				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelperDialog\"\>Allows you to activate the automatic Help Agent. You can also activate the Help Agent through \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - General - Help Agent\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelpTip\"\>Enables the display of icon names at the mouse pointer and other Help contents.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
