helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3148981				0	hr	Američki engleski				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	hr	Numbers formatted in US English are searched for and included regardless of the system language. A number format is not applied. If there are no US English entries, the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> format is applied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3154329				0	hr	Sakrij				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3154946				0	hr	Podaci u stupcima se ne uvoze.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3149767				0	hr	Ako odaberete jedan od oblika datuma (DMG), (MDG) ili (GMD) i upišete brojeve bez razdjelnika datuma, brojevi će bit protumačeni kako slijedi:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150650	76			0	hr	Number of characters 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495				0	hr	Oblik datuma				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	hr	6				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153056				0	hr	Po dva znaka se uzimaju za dan, mjesec i godinu odabranim redoslijedom.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147352				0	hr	8				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	hr	Četiri znaka se uzimaju za godinu, a po dva za mjesec i dan, odabranim redoslijedom.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147295				0	hr	5 ili 7				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	hr	Kao s 6 ili 8 znakova, ali prvi dio niza ima jedan znak manje. Ovako će se početna nula za mjesec i dan.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143				0	hr	If you want to include the leading zero in the data you import, in telephone numbers for example, apply the "Text" format to the column.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149287				0	hr	Pregled				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147377				0	hr	Shows how the imported text will look after it is separated into columns. To apply a format to a column when it is imported, click a column and select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>. When you select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>, the column heading displays the applied format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150105				0	hr	Ako želite koristiti nepromjenjivu širinu da biste razdijelili uvezene podatke u stupce, klikom na ravnalo odredite širinu stupca.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3155746				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"Navigating Without the Mouse\"\>Navigating Without the Mouse\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	hr	For more information, see \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Information about Import and Export Filters\"\>Information about Import and Export Filters\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Kontekstni izbornici				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3160447				0	hr	Kontekstni izbornici				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148765				0	hr	Izreži				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383				0	hr	Cuts out the selected object and stores it on the clipboard. The object can be reinserted from the clipboard by using \<emph\>Paste\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156069				0	hr	Umetni				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154896				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_PASTE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the element that you moved to the clipboard into the document.\</ahelp\> This command can only be called if the contents of the clipboard can be inserted at the current cursor position.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149948				0	hr	Ubaci				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	hr	Opens a submenu in the Gallery where you can choose between \<emph\>Copy\</emph\> and \<emph\>Link\</emph\>. The selected Gallery object is either copied into the current document or a link is created.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130				0	hr	Ako si odabrao objekt u svome dokumentu, tada novi unos će zamijeniti selektirani objekt.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145829				0	hr	Pozadina				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149180				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_BACKGROUND\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the selected picture as a background graphic.\</ahelp\> Use the submenu commands \<emph\>Page\</emph\> or \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> to define whether the graphic should cover the entire page or only the current paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153049				0	hr	Kopiraj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_COPY\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Copies the selected element to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148620				0	hr	Obriši				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	hr	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_DESTROY\"\>Deletes the current selection. If multiple objects are selected, all will be deleted. In most cases, a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03150100.xhp\" name=\"security query\"\>security query\</link\> appears before objects are deleted.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	hr	Objekt je ili fizički obrisan ili je prikaz objekta uklonjen, ovisno o kontekstu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	hr	If you choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> while in the Gallery, the entry will be deleted from the Gallery, but the file itself will remain untouched.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150443				0	hr	Otvori				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	137			0	hr	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_OPEN_OBJECT\"\>Use the\<emph\> Open \</emph\>command to open the selected object in a new task.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149732				0	hr	Preimenuj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enables a selected object to be renamed.\</ahelp\> After selecting \<emph\>Rename\</emph\> the name is selected and a new one can be entered directly. Use the arrow keys to set the cursor at the beginning or end of the name to delete or add to part of the name or to reposition the cursor.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155434				0	hr	Ažuriraj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154898				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_ACTUALIZE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the view in the window or in the selected object.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573				0	hr	Pregled				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155583				0	hr	Odabrani element se prikazuje u galeriji pri maksimalnoj veličini. Dvostruko kliknite na pregled da biste se vratili u normalni pogled galerije.				20181231 09:50:43
