helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Glossary of Internet Terms				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150702				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>common terms;Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>glossaries;Internet terms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>terminology;Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150702				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Glossary of Internet Terms\"\>Glossary of Internet Terms\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	hr	Ako ste novi na Internetu, susresti ćete se s mnogo nepoznatih termina: preglednik, bilješka, e-pošta, polazna stranica, tražilica, i mnogi drugi. Kako bi vam prvi koraci bili lakši, ovaj pojmovnik će vam objasniti neke važnije pojmove koje ćete susresti an Internetu, intranetu, pošti i interesnim grupama.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153146				0	hr	Okviri				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	hr	Frames are useful for designing the layout of\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> pages. $[officename] uses floating frames into which you can place objects such as graphics, movie files and sound. The context menu of a frame shows the options for restoring or editing frame contents. Some of these commands are also listed in \<emph\>Edit - Object\</emph\> when the frame is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147077				0	hr	FTP				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	hr	FTP je skraćenica od File transfer Protocol i označava standardni protokol za prijenos podataka na Internetu. FTP poslužitelj je program na računalu koji pohranjuje datoteke koje će se prenesti uz pomoć FTP-a. Dok je FTP odgovoran za slanje i primanje datoteka internetom, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#http\" name=\"HTTP\"\>HTTP\</link\> (Hypertext Transfer Protocol) uspostavlja vezu i prenosi podatke između WWW servera i klijenata.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145609				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>HTML; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	hr	HTML				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3161459				0	hr	HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) is a document code language, which is used as the file format for WWW documents. It is derived from \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#sgml\" name=\"SGML\"\>SGML\</link\> and integrates text, graphics, videos and sound.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346	58			0	hr	If you want to type HTML commands directly, for example when doing exercises from one of the many available HTML books, remember that HTML pages are pure text files. Save your document under the document type \<emph\>Text \</emph\>and give it the file name extension .HTM. Be sure there are no umlauts or other special characters of the extended character set. If you want to re-open this file in $[officename] and edit the HTML code, you must load it with the file type \<emph\>Text\</emph\> and not with the file type \<emph\>Web pages\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	hr	There are several references on the Internet providing an introduction to the HTML language.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147423				0	hr	HTTP				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	hr	Hypertext Transfer Protocol definira način transmisije WWW dokumenata između WWW poslužitelja (hostova) i preglednika (klijenata).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149290				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>hyperlinks; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149290				0	hr	Hiperveza				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	hr	Hyperlinks are cross-references, highlighted in text in various colors and activated by mouse-click. With the aid of hyperlinks, readers can jump to specific information within a document as well as to related information in other documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	hr	U $[officename] možete zadati hiperlinkove, kako na tekst, tako i na slike i tekstualne okvire (vidi ikonicu za Hiperlink Dijalog na Standard traci s alatima).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152805				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>ImageMap; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152805				0	hr	Mapa slika				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	hr	An ImageMap is a reference-sensitive graphic or text frame. You can click on defined areas of the graphic or text frame to go to a target (\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>), which is linked with the area. The reference areas, along with the linked URLs and corresponding text displayed when resting the mouse pointer on these areas, are defined in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02220000.xhp\" name=\"ImageMap Editor\"\>ImageMap Editor\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	hr	There are two different types of ImageMaps. A Client Side ImageMap is evaluated on the client computer, which loaded the graphic from the Internet, while a Server Side ImageMap is evaluated on the server computer which provides the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> page on the Internet. In server evaluation, clicking an ImageMap sends the relative coordinates of the cursor within the image to the server, and a dedicated program on the server responds. In the client evaluation, clicking a defined hotspot of the ImageMap activates the URL, as if it were a normal text link. The URL appears below the mouse pointer when passing across the ImageMap.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	hr	As ImageMaps can be used in different ways, they can be stored in different formats.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146874				0	hr	Oblici slikovnih mapa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145153				0	hr	ImageMaps are basically divided between those that are analyzed on the server (i. e. your Internet provider) and those analyzed on the web browser of the reader's computer.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152881				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Server Side ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152881				0	hr	Slikovne mape na strani poslužitelja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153057				0	hr	Slikovne mape na strani poslužitelja se čitatelju čine kao slika ili okvir na stranici. Klikom na slikovnu mapu koordinate i relativni položaj šalju se poslužitelju. Uz pomoć dodatnog programa, poslužitelj određuje koji je sljedeći korak koji treba poduzeti. Postoji nekoliko nekompatibilnih metoda kojim se definira ovaj proces, dvije najčešće su:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147502				0	hr	W3C (CERN) HTTP Server (Tip oblika: MAP - CERN)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	hr	NCSA HTTP Server (Format type: MAP - NCSA)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483	74			0	hr	$[officename] creates ImageMaps for both methods. Select the format from the \<emph\>Save as type \</emph\>list in the \<emph\>Save As \</emph\>dialog in the \<emph\>ImageMap Editor\</emph\>. Separate Map Files are created which you must upload to the server. You will need to ask your provider or network administrator which type of ImageMaps are supported by the server and how to access the evaluation program.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152418				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Client Side ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152418				0	hr	Slikovne mape na klijent strani				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3151290				0	hr	The area of the picture or frame where the reader can click is indicated by the appearance of the linked \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> when the mouse passes over the area. The ImageMap is stored in a layer below the picture and contains information about the referenced regions. The only disadvantage of Client Side ImageMaps is that older Web browsers cannot read them; a disadvantage that will, however, resolve itself in time.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	hr	When saving the ImageMap, select the file type \<emph\>SIP - StarView ImageMap\</emph\>. This saves the ImageMap directly in a format which can be applied to every active picture or frame in your document. However, if you just want to use the ImageMap on the current picture or text frame, you do not have to save it in any special format. After defining the regions, simply click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\>. Nothing more is necessary. Client Side ImageMaps saved in \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> format are inserted directly into the page in HTML code.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159125				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Java; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159125				0	hr	Java				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	hr	The Java programming language is a platform independent programming language developed by Sun Microsystems, Inc. (http://www.sun.com) that is especially suited for use in the Internet. Web pages and applications programmed with Java class files can be used on all modern operating systems. Programs using Java programming language are usually developed in a Java development environment and then compiled to a "byte code". A .class file is created, which can then be inserted as a "Java Applet" into HTML pages. Several .class files can be combined to a single .jar or .zip file. A Web browser that supports the Java class files can compile the Java programming language code immediately after receipt without the user having to unpack the archive.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159153				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>plug-ins; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	hr	Priključci				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154127				0	hr	Extensions providing additional functionality in Web browsers are referred to as Plug-Ins.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147484				0	hr	Umetak je termin koji se koristi u raznim kontekstima:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168608				0	hr	Plug-Ins in $[officename]				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149910				0	hr	You will notice in $[officename] that the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar changes after certain operations. For example, if you insert a formula into your text document, you see icons for editing the formula, in fact the same icons you see in formula documents. In this sense, we refer to the formula as a plug-in within the text document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148387				0	hr	Korištenje umetaka za proširivanje vaših programa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156737				0	hr	Plug-ins, generally speaking, are software additions to particular applications which provide enhanced functionality. Often import and export filters for various file formats are stored as plug-ins in a plug-in directory.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	hr	Netscape web browser extensions produced by Netscape Communication Corporation are also called plug-ins. These are external programs mainly taken from the multimedia field and which communicate with the browser through standardized interfaces. These plug-ins can be linked to $[officename] documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149420				0	hr	Any Netscape plug-ins (32 bit) installed on your system are automatically recognized by $[officename]. Otherwise, copy the plug-in files to [netinstall_officepath]/share/plugin.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145647				0	hr	Proxy				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	hr	A proxy is a computer in the network acting as a kind of clipboard for data transfer. Whenever you access the Internet from a company network and request a Web page that has already been read by a colleague, the proxy will be able to display the page much quicker, as long as it's still in the memory. All that has to be checked in this case is that the page stored in the proxy is the latest version. If this is the case, the page won't have to be downloaded from the much slower Internet but can be loaded directly from the proxy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154729				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>SGML; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	hr	SGML				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147330				0	hr	SGML stands for "Standard Generalized Markup Language". SGML is based on the idea that documents have structural and other semantic elements that can be described without reference to how such elements should be displayed. The actual display of such a document may vary, depending on the output medium and style preferences. In structured texts, SGML not only defines structures (in the DTD = Document Type Definition) but also ensures they are consistently used.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148747				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> is a specialized application of SGML. This means that most Web browsers support only a limited range of SGML standards and that almost all SGML-enabled systems can produce attractive HTML pages.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153950				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>search engines; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153950				0	hr	Tražilice				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3157965				0	hr	Tražilica je usluga na Internetu koja se zasniva na softveru koji pretražuje veliku količinu podataka korištenjem ključnih riječi.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150751				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>tags; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150751				0	hr	Tagovi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156360				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> pages contain certain structural and formatting instructions called tags. Tags are code words enclosed by brackets in the document description language HTML. Many tags contain text or hyperlink references between the opening and closing brackets. For example, titles are marked by the tags <h1> at the beginning and </h1> at the end of the title. Some tags only appear on their own such as <br> for a line break or <img ...> to link a graphic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153766				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>URL; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153766				0	hr	URL				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3152931				0	hr	The Uniform Resource Locator (URL) displays the address of a document or a server in the Internet. The general structure of a URL varies according to type and is generally in the form Service://Hostname:Port/Path/Page#Mark although not all elements are always required. An URL can be a FTP address, a WWW (HTTP) address, a file address or an e-mail address.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Izvoz tekstualnih datoteka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	hr	Izvoz tekstualnih datoteka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150379				0	hr	The \<emph\>Export of text files\</emph\> dialog allows you to define the export options for text files. The dialog will be displayed if you save spreadsheet data as file type "Text CSV", and if the \<emph\>Edit filter settings\</emph\> check box is marked in the \<emph\>Save As\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155577				0	hr	Odrednice polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152427				0	hr	Određuje separator polja, separator teksta i skup znakova koji će se koristiti za izvoz teksta.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152876				0	hr	Znakovni skup				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154689				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT:DDLB_FONT\"\>Specifies the character set for text export.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
