helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154863				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:COMBOBOX:RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT:ED_TEXTSEP\"\>Choose or enter the text delimiter, which encloses every data field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id783149793				0	hr	Quote all text cells				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152778363				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Exports all text cells with leading and trailing quote characters as set in the Text delimiter box. If not checked, only those text cells get quoted that contain the Field delimiter character.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id7145298				0	hr	Save cell content as shown				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id5719779				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enabled by default, data will be saved as displayed, including applied number formats. If this checkbox is not marked, raw data content will be saved, as in older versions of the software.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	hr	Depending on the number format, saving cell content as shown may write values that during an import cannot be interpreted as numerical values anymore.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149793				0	hr	Nepromjenjiva širina stupca				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT_CB_FIXEDWIDTH\"\>Exports all data fields with a fixed width.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	hr	Širina polja podataka u izvezenoj tekstualnoj datoteci postavlja se kao trenutačna širina odgovarajućeg stupca.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116				0	hr	Vrijednosti se izvoze u formatu kakav je trenutačno vidljiv u ćeliji.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	hr	If a value is longer than the fixed column width, it will be exported as a ### string.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	hr	Ako je tekstualni niz znakova dulji od širine stupca, bit će skraćen na kraju.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	hr	Lijevo, sredenje i desno poravnanje bit će simulirano umetnutim prazninama.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Showing and Hiding Docked Windows				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3085157				0	hr	Showing and Hiding Docked Windows				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149948				0	hr	Every \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"docked\"\>docked\</link\> window has an icon to control the display properties of the window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	hr	To show or hide a docked window, click the icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150465				0	hr	AutoShow and AutoHide Docked Windows				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504				0	hr	You can click the edge of a hidden docked window to open the window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153257				0	hr	The docked window closes automatically when you move the mouse pointer outside of the window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	hr	Multiple docked windows act as a single window in AutoShow/AutoHide mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145416				0	hr	Vuci i ispusti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	hr	If you drag an object over the edge of a hidden docked window, the window opens in AutoShow mode.				20181231 09:50:43
