helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10725				0	hr	The OpenDocument file format is an XML file format standardized by \<link href=\"http://www.oasis-open.org\"\>OASIS\</link\> (Organization for the Advancement of Structured Information Standards).				20181231 09:50:43
