helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	hr	This wizard is visible for the evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME. If you are using a time-limited evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME, you can purchase a license online. You will get a serial number to change your %PRODUCTNAME to a full version.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	hr	The wizard can be called any time from the Help menu. The wizard will be offered automatically starting five days before the evaluation period expires.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	hr	The wizard consists of the following steps:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	hr	Purchase %PRODUCTNAME				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the welcome page of the wizard. If you want to buy a serial number online, click the button. If you already have a serial number, click Next to enter the number on the next page.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	hr	Get your serial number online				20181231 09:50:43
