helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3144740				0	hr	Determines that you want one option field to be selected as the default choice.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094				0	hr	The default settings will be accepted if you open the form in the user mode. With these settings you determine the control property \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Default Status\"\>Default Status\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157896				0	hr	Da li da jedno polje opcija bude odabrano kao podrazumijevano?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	hr	Specifies whether you want to set default settings for the option box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	hr	Da, sljedeće:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_DEFAULTFIELDSELECTION_RB_DEFSELECTION_YES\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies that you want an option field to be selected as a default after opening the form.\</ahelp\> Choose the option field from the box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	hr	List box				20181231 09:50:43
