helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGREPORT_2_GROUPING\"\>Lists the fields from your selection on the previous page of the Wizard. To group the report by a field, select the field name, then click the \<emph\>>\</emph\> button. You may select up to four levels of grouping.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
