helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	hr	The \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar can be used to search for the selected text in the Internet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10620				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\> to open the Hyperlink Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
