helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10650				0	hr	While pressing the Shift key click the first and then the last sheet tab to select all sheets.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	hr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+A\</item\> to select the whole text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F0				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Default Formatting\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	hr	Removing all Direct Formatting in a $[officename] Presentation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Outline\</emph\> tab to open outline view.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\undo_formatting.xhp	0	help	par_id3906674				0	hr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+A\</item\> to select the whole text.				20181231 09:50:43
