helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148914	17			0	hr	Neither the start-up logo nor the initial program window will be visible. However, the $[officename] software can be controlled and documents and dialogs opened via the \<link href=\"https://api.openoffice.org\" name=\"API\"\>API\</link\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147341	18			0	hr	When the $[officename] software has been started with this parameter, it can only be ended using the taskmanager (Windows) or the \<emph\>kill \</emph\>command (UNIX based systems).				20181231 09:50:43
