helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	hr	Using a Report				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	hr	%PRODUCTNAME stores the information about the created reports in the database file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the database file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	hr	In the database file window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	hr	Double-click one of the report names to open the report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	hr	These links are added automatically when you create a new report by the Report Wizard or in the Report Designer window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id1695608				0	hr	Editing a Report Created in the Report Designer Window				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id7510910				0	hr	Right-click the name of a report in the database file window, then choose Edit.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id8138065				0	hr	The Report Designer window opens with the report's information loaded. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id5086825				0	hr	Use the toolbars and menu commands and drag-and-drop to edit the report as stated in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Designer\</link\> guide.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id4747154				0	hr	Execute the report to see the resulting report document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153104				0	hr	Editing a Report Created by the Report Wizard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	hr	On the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100500.xhp\" name=\"last dialog page of the Report AutoPilot\"\>last dialog page of the Report Wizard\</link\>, you can choose to edit the report template before you use the report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431				0	hr	You can edit the page styles for the first page and the following pages of the report as well as the paragraph styles, the number formats, the printed field labels, and more.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D7				0	hr	Unless you have a thorough understanding of the database the report accesses, do not edit the SQL statement, database name, the hidden form controls, or the related information on the report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Umetni Ovjekti iz galerije				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145136				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Gallery; inserting pictures from\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; inserting from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects; inserting from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;pictures from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>patterns for objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>textures;inserting from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds;inserting from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;objects from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copying;from Gallery\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136	1			0	hr	\<variable id=\"gallery_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/gallery_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Objects From the Gallery\"\>Inserting Objects From the Gallery\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hr	You can insert an object in a document either as a \<emph\>copy\</emph\> or as a \<emph\>link\</emph\>. A copy of an object is independent of the original object. Changes to the original object have no effect on the copy. A link remains dependent on the original object. Changes to the original object are also reflected in the link.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145313				0	hr	Inserting an object as a copy				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	hr	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306				0	hr	Select a theme.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154516				0	hr	Select an object using a single click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	hr	Drag the object into the document, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Copy\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153061				0	hr	Inserting an object as a link				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	hr	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	hr	Select a theme.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	hr	Select an object by a single click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	hr	Drag the object into the document while pressing the Shift and Ctrl keys, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Link\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156282				0	hr	Inserting an object as a background graphic				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	hr	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	hr	Select a theme.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	hr	Select an object by a single click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147289				0	hr	Open the context menu and choose \<emph\>Insert - Background - Page\</emph\> or \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
