helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	bm_id380260				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Format Paintbrush\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatting;copying\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copying;formatting\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053A				0	hr	\<variable id=\"formatpaintbrush\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/paintbrush.xhp\"\>Copying Formatting With the Format Paintbrush\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	hr	You can use the Format Paintbrush tool to copy formatting from a text selection or object and apply the formatting to another text selection or object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_id101920091122570				0	hr	In Calc, the Format Paintbrush only applies to cell formatting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	hr	Select the text or object whose formatting you want to copy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	hr	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	hr	The cursor changes to a paint bucket.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	hr	If you want to apply the formatting to more than one selection, double-click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id209967\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id209967\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. After you apply all the formatting, click the icon again.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066E				0	hr	Select or click the text or object that you want to apply the formatting to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	hr	To exclude paragraph formatting, hold down Ctrl when you click. To exclude character formatting, hold down Ctrl+Shift when you click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	hr	The following table describes the formatting attributes that the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> can copy:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10691				0	hr	Type of Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10697				0	hr	Komentar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069E				0	hr	Nothing selected, but cursor is inside a text passage				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	hr	Copies the formatting of the current paragraph and the character formatting of the next character in the text flow direction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	hr	Text is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B1				0	hr	Copies the formatting of the last selected character and of the paragraph that contains the character.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	hr	Frame is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BE				0	hr	Copies the frame attributes that are defined in Format - Frame dialog. The contents, size, position, linking, hyperlinks, and macros in the frame are not copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	hr	Object is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CB				0	hr	Copies the object formatting that is defined in the Format - Graphics or Format - Object dialogs. The contents, size, position, hyperlinks, and macros in the object are not copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D2				0	hr	Form control is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D8				0	hr	Nije podržano				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	hr	Drawing object is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E5				0	hr	Copies all formatting attributes. In Impress and Draw, the text contents of the object is also copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	hr	Text within drawing object or within Calc cells is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F2				0	hr	Nije podržano				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F9				0	hr	Writer table or cells are selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FF				0	hr	Copies the formatting that is specified in Table, Text Flow, Borders, and Background tab pages in the Format - Table dialog. The paragraph and character formatting are also copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	hr	Calc table or cells are selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070C				0	hr	Copies the formatting that is specified in the Format - Cells dialog as well as the formatting of the cell contents				20181231 09:50:43
