helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	hr	\<variable id=\"data_new\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_new.xhp\"\>Creating a New Database\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
