helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CB				0	hr	This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/dabawiz00.xhp\"\>Database Wizard\</link\>, where you create a new database file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DD				0	hr	In the Database Wizard, select the type of database, and select the option to open the Table Wizard as the next wizard.				20181231 09:50:43
