helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	hr	In the context menu choose \<emph\>Object Properties\</emph\>. Then choose the \<emph\>Area\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
