helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	hr	\<variable id=\"print_faster\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/print_faster.xhp\"\>Printing faster with Reduced Data\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C8				0	hr	You can decide to reduce the data necessary to print your document. The settings can be defined differently for printing directly to the printer or for printing to a file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CE				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - Print\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D6				0	hr	Click one of the following settings options: 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D9				0	hr	\<emph\>Printer\</emph\>\<emph\>- \</emph\>to define options for reducing data while printing directly to a printer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	hr	\<emph\>Print to file\</emph\>\<emph\>-\</emph\> to define options for reducing data while printing to a file				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	hr	Select any combination of the four options, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	hr	All documents that you print from now on will use the changed options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F3				0	hr	Print your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	hr	You can reduce data for transparency, for gradients, or for bitmaps. When you reduce the data, on many printers you will not see a reduction of printing quality. But the printing time is substantially shorter, and when you print to a file, the file size is much smaller.				20181231 09:50:43
