helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars - Form Controls\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hr	On the Form Controls toolbar, click the \<emph\>Push Button\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
