helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153825				0	hr	\<variable id=\"linestyle_define\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/linestyle_define.xhp\" name=\"Defining Line Styles\"\>Defining Line Styles\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	hr	Select a line drawing object in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419	14			0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Object - Line\</item\> and click the \<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	hr	Specify the line options that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	hr	To specify the length of the line as a percentage of the line width, select \<emph\>Fit to line width\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
