helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon or press the shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+S.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450				0	hr	\<image id=\"img_id3152349\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_save.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152349\"\>This icon is for tips on how to use the program more effectively.\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	hr	The document is saved under its path and name on the current local data medium or network drive or on the Internet, overwriting any file of the same name.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	hr	When you save a new file for the first time, the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>Save As\</link\> dialog opens, in which you can enter a name, folder and drive or volume for the file. To open this dialog, choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	hr	You can set the automatic creation of a backup copy under \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Load/Save - General\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Load/Save - General\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	hd_id7146824				0	hr	Automatic extension to the file name				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id9359111				0	hr	When saving a file, %PRODUCTNAME always appends an extension to the file name, except when the file name already has an extension that matches the file type. See the list of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\"\>ODF extensions\</link\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
