helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252	7			0	hr	If you want the file dialogs to offer another file format as default, select that format in \<emph\>Tools - Options - Load/Save - General\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Standard file format \</emph\>area.				20181231 09:50:43
