helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_LB_RESULT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the headings of the pages found in your full-text search. To display a page, double-click its entry.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_FULLWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to carry out an exact search for the word you entered. Incomplete words will not be found.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_SCOPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to only search in document headings for the search term.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_OPEN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the entry selected in the list.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	hr	The full text search function in $[officename] Help allows you to find Help documents that contain any combination of search terms. To do this, type one or more words into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	hr	The \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field stores the words you entered last. To repeat a previous search, click the arrow icon and select the term from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	hr	After the search has been carried out, the document headings of the results appear in a list. Either double-click an entry, or select it and click \<emph\>Display\</emph\> to load the corresponding Help document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	hr	Use the check box \<emph\>Find in headings only\</emph\> to limit the search to document headings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	hr	The \<emph\>Complete words only\</emph\> check box allows you to perform an exact search. If this box is marked, incomplete words will not be found. Do not mark this check box if the search term you enter should also be found as part of a longer word.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	hr	You can enter any combination of search terms, separated by spaces. Searching is not case-sensitive.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	hr	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	hr	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	hr	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Help Page Not Found				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	hr	Could not find Help page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	hr	Unfortunately the Help page you selected was not found. The following data could be helpful in locating the error:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3143268				0	hr	Help ID: \<emph\>\<help-id-missing/\>\</emph\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	hr	You can install missing Help modules using the Setup application.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541	16			0	hr	Click \<image id=\"img_id3148946\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148946\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>\<emph\>Back\</emph\> to return to the previous page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Icons in the Documentation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>Icons in the Documentation\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	hr	Icons in the Documentation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	hr	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	hr	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	hr	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	hr	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tooltips; help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599				0	hr	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	hr	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	hr	The Help Agent				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	hr	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	hr	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	hr	Savjeti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	hr	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	hr	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	hr	Enable or disable the tips on \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	hr	Prošireni savjeti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	hr	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	hr	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
