helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	hr	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	hr	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	hr	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	hr	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	hr	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	hr	The Help system for OpenOffice.org and commercial software from Sun Microsystems, Inc. is based on the same source files. Some of the functions described here may not be included in this particular \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelpOnHelp\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Provides an overview of the Help system\</ahelp\>The Help window shows the currently selected Help page.				20181231 09:50:43
