helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the language used for the user interface, for example menus, dialogs, help files.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445727				0	hr	The "Default" entry selects the language of the user interface for the operating system. If this language is not available in the %PRODUCTNAME installation, the language of the %PRODUCTNAME installation is the default language.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154751				0	hr	Lokalne postavke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_LOCALESETTING\"\>Specifies the locale setting of the country setting.\</ahelp\> This influences settings for numbering, currency and units of measure.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445950				0	hr	The "Default" entry selects the locale setting that is selected for the operating system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	hr	A change in this field is immediately applicable. However, some formats that were formatted by default change only if the document is newly loaded.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	hr	Decimal separator key - Same as locale setting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies to use the decimal separator key that is set in your system when you press the respective key on the number pad.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F1				0	hr	If this checkbox is activated, the character shown after "Same as locale setting" is inserted when you press the key on the number pad. If this checkbox is not activated, the character that your keyboard driver software provides is inserted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147209				0	hr	Default currency				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_CURRENCY\"\>Specifies the default currency that is used for the currency format and the currency fields.\</ahelp\> If you change the locale setting, the default currency changes automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	hr	The default entry applies to the currency format that is assigned to the selected locale setting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	hr	A change in \<emph\>Default currency\</emph\> field will be transmitted to all open documents and will lead to corresponding changes in the dialogs and icons that control the currency format in these documents.				20181231 09:50:43
