helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057C				0	hr	Only macros from trusted file locations are allowed to run. All other macros, regardless of whether they are signed or not, are disabled.				20181231 09:50:43
