helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trusted sources can be set on the Trusted Sources tab page. Signed macros from a trusted source are allowed to run. In addition, any macro from a trusted file location is allowed to run. All other macros require your confirmation.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
