helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	hr	Defines the print order for $[officename] Writer documents with multiple pages.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150874				0	hr	Left pages (not for HTML documents)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTPRINT_PAGE:CB_LEFTP\"\>Specifies whether to print all left pages of the document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
