helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3289590				0	hr	The Stored Web Connection Information dialog shows a list of web sites and user names that you entered previously. You can select any entry and remove it from the list. You can view the password for the selected entry.				20181231 09:50:43
