helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id1981261				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens a dialog where you can view and change the password for the selected entry.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
