helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151245				0	hr	Compress punctuation and Japanese Kana				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_PUNCT_KANA_COMP\"\>Specifies that punctuation and Japanese Kana are compressed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	hr	Prvi i posljednji znak				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	hr	Defines the default settings for 'first' and 'last' characters. In the dialog that appears when you choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>\<emph\>Asian Typography\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify whether the list of forbidden characters applies to those at the beginning or end of a line in a paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154071				0	hr	Jezik				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Specifies the language for which you want to define first and last characters.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145606				0	hr	Uobičajeno				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920	22			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_CB_STANDARD\"\>When you mark\<emph\> Default\</emph\>, the following two text boxes are filled with the default characters for the selected language:\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	hr	Ne na početku linije:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically moved to the end of the previous line. For example, an exclamation point at the end of a sentence never appears at the start of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	hr	Ne na kraju linije:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the end of a line due to a line break, it is automatically moved to the beginning of the next line. For example, a currency symbol that appears in front of an amount never appears at the end of a line if it is part of the\<emph\> Not at end of line\</emph\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Start Parameters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10545				0	hr	Java početni parametri				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10549				0	hr	You can use this dialog to enter optional start parameters for the Java runtime environment (JRE). The settings that you specify in this dialog are valid for any JRE that you start.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	hr	Java Start parameter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:Edit:RID_SVXDLG_JAVA_PARAMETER:ED_PARAMETER\"\>Enter a start parameter for a JRE as you would on a command line. Click Assign to add the parameter to the list of available start parameters.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_id5404522				0	hr	Do not use escape characters or quotes in path names.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D8				0	hr	For example, to point the system property "myprop" to a folder, enter the following parameter:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DD				0	hr	-Dmyprop=c:\\program files\\java				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	hr	To enable debugging in a JRE, enter the following parameters:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057E				0	hr	-Xdebug				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	hr	-Xrunjdwp:transport=dt_socket,server=y,address=8000				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1060C				0	hr	These changes take effect after you restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	hr	Assigned start parameters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:ListBox:RID_SVXDLG_JAVA_PARAMETER:LB_ASSIGNED\"\>Lists the assigned JRE start parameters. To remove a start parameter, select the parameter, and then click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
