helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hr	The \<emph\>Search Options for Japanese\</emph\> and \<emph\>Asian Layout\</emph\> tab pages are only visible if the \<emph\>Asian language support\</emph\> option in the \<emph\>Languages\</emph\> tab page is activated and the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog is re-opened. The \<emph\>Complex Text Layout\</emph\> tab page is only visible if the \<emph\>CTL support\</emph\> is enabled.				20181231 09:50:43
