helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153627				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_RB_ORIGINAL_SIZE\"\>Prints the formula without adjusting the current font size.\</ahelp\> It is possible that with large formulas a part of the command text is cut off.				20181231 09:50:43
