helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	hr	System: All numbers are shown using Arabic or Hindi numerals, according to the locale settings defined by your system locale.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	hr	This setting is not saved in the document but in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> configuration.				20181231 09:50:43
