helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_BACKUP\"\>Saves the previous version of a document as a backup copy whenever you save a document. Every time \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> creates a backup copy, the previous backup copy is replaced. The backup copy gets the extension .BAK.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	hr	To change the location of the backup copy, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME\</emph\>\<emph\>- Paths\</emph\>, and then enter a new path for the backup file.				20181231 09:50:43
