helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:ED_STEPS\"\>Sets the maximum number of iteration steps.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153728				0	hr	Minimalna promjena				20181231 09:50:43
