helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145150				0	hr	Preciznost kao što je prikazano				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150644				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:BTN_CALC\"\>Specifies whether to make calculations using the rounded values displayed in the sheet. Charts will be shown with the displayed values. If the \<emph\>Precision as shown\</emph\> option is not marked, the displayed numbers are rounded, but they are calculated internally using the non-rounded number.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
