helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	hr	To protect the recording state with a password, click \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> and enter a password. Other users of this document can apply their changes, but they cannot disable change recording without knowing the password.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D0				0	hr	Protect / Unprotect				20181231 09:50:43
