helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148410				0	hr	\<variable id=\"frameeinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertObjectFloatingFra\"\>Inserts a floating frame into the current document. Floating frames are used in HTML documents to display the contents of another file. Floating frames are not supported by Netscape Navigator 4.x.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	hr	If you want to create HTML pages that use floating frames, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - Load/Save - HTML compatibility\</emph\>, and then select the "MS Internet Explorer" option. The floating frame is bounded by <IFRAME> and </IFRAME> tags.				20181231 09:50:43
