helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	hd_id315256				0	hr	\<variable id=\"online_update\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/online_update.xhp\"\>Online Update\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3174230				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mark to enable the automatic check for updates. Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update to disable or enable this feature.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id0116200901063996				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to select a folder to download the files.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6797082				0	hr	Your version of %PRODUCTNAME can check for updates to the program code automatically. You can disable or enable the automatic check in Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/online_update.xhp\"\>Online Update\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4218878				0	hr	Checking for updates will also look for updates of all installed extensions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8132267				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - Check for Updates\</item\> to check manually.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id702230				0	hr	You can disable or enable the automatic check in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/online_update.xhp\"\>Online Update\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3422345				0	hr	If an update is available, an icon \<image id=\"img_id3155415\" src=\"extensions/source/update/ui/onlineupdate_16.png\" width=\"0.4598inch\" height=\"0.1402inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155415\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the menu bar will notify you of the update. Click the icon to open a dialog with more information.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9313638				0	hr	You will see a dialog with some information about the online update of %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9951780				0	hr	Enable an Internet connection for %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6479384				0	hr	If you need a proxy server, enter the proxy settings in Tools - Options - Internet - Proxy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3639027				0	hr	Choose Check for Updates to check for the availability of a newer version of your office suite.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3722342				0	hr	If a newer version is available and %PRODUCTNAME is not set up for automatic downloading, then you can select any of the following actions:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id5106662				0	hr	Download and install the new version.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4931485				0	hr	Only download the new files to install them manually later.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9168980				0	hr	Abort this check for updates for now.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9766533				0	hr	If %PRODUCTNAME is configured to download the files automatically, the download starts immediately. A download continues even when you minimize the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id927152				0	hr	If automatic downloads are disabled, start the download manually.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6081728				0	hr	If no update was found, you can close the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9219641				0	hr	You need Administrator rights to update %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	HTML import and export				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154380				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>importing; HTML with META tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exporting; to HTML\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>HTML; importing META tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>HTML documents; META tags in\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>META tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tags; META tags\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154380				0	hr	HTML import and export				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	hr	When you export a file to an HTML document, the description and the user-defined file properties are included as META \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tags\"\>tags\</link\> between the HEAD tags of the exported document. META tags are not displayed in a Web browser, and are used to include information, such as keywords for search engines on your Web page. To set the properties of the current document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Description\</emph\> or \<emph\>User Defined\</emph\> tabs, and then type the information you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	hr	The following file properties are converted to META tags when you export a file as an HTML document:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3154935				0	hr	File Property				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	hr	<TITLE>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3153778				0	hr	Subjekt				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	hr	<META NAME="CLASSIFICATION" CONTENT="Field Content">				20181231 09:50:43
