helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146060				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HangulHanjaConversion\"\>Converts the selected Korean text from Hangul to Hanja or from Hanja to Hangul.\</ahelp\> The menu command can only be called if you enable Asian language support under \<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, and if a text formatted in Korean language is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
