helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149205				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HANGULDLG_EDIT_NEWWORD\"\>Displays the first replacement suggestion from the dictionary.\</ahelp\> You can edit the suggested word or enter another word. Click the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> button to replace your original word with the corresponding replacement word.				20181231 09:50:43
