helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id76				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to print the current date and time.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id78				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to print the pages that are currently hidden.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
