helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id90				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to scale down objects that are beyond the margins of the current printer so they fit on the paper in the printer.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id92				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies that pages are to be printed in tiled format. If the pages or slides are smaller than the paper, several pages or slides will be printed on one page of paper.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285074				0	hr	%PRODUCTNAME Writer / Calc / Impress / Draw / Math				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285019				0	hr	The tab page with the same name as the current application can be used to define the contents, color, size, and pages to be printed. You define settings that are specific to the current document type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285112				0	hr	Page Layout				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285150				0	hr	The Page Layout tab page can be used to save some sheets of paper by printing several pages onto each sheet of paper. You define the arrangement and size of output pages on the physical paper.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904164735				0	hr	Change the arrangement of pages to be printed on every sheet of paper. The preview shows how every final sheet of paper will look.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904102987				0	hr	For some document types, you can choose to print a brochure.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285138				0	hr	Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285146				0	hr	On the Options tab page you can set some additional options for the current print job. Here you can specify to print to a file instead of printing on a printer.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0819200910481678				0	hr	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Unix hints\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157320				0	hr	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>If you want, you can use the STAR_SPOOL_DIR environment variable to specify the directory where the Xprinter spoolfiles are saved. For example: \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154330				0	hr	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>setenv STAR_SPOOL_DIR /usr/local/tmp (in the csh/tcsh) or \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	hr	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>export STAR_SPOOL_DIR=/usr/local/tmp (in the sh/bash) \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	hr	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>You can also use the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/spadmin.xhp\" name=\"spadmin printer setup program\"\>spadmin printer setup program\</link\> to specify additional printer options. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
