helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155182				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05110200.xhp\" name=\"Italic\"\>Italic\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148882				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Italic\"\>Makes the selected text italic. If the cursor is in a word, the entire word is made italic. If the selection or word is already italic, the formatting is removed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156069				0	hr	If the cursor is not inside a word, and no text is selected, then the font style is applied to the text that you type.				20181231 09:50:43
