helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	hr	Automatically aligns objects to vertical and horizontal grid lines. To override this feature, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Control key \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you drag an object.				20181231 09:50:43
