helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	hr	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	hr	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
