helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id87282				0	hr	Text will be replaced after you type a trailing white space (space, tab, or return). In the following table, the A and B represent text consisting of letters A to z or digits 0 to 9.				20181231 09:50:43
