helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230402.xhp	0	help	par_id3151114	23			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINING_FILTER_ED_COMMENT\"\>Filters the comments of the changes according to the keyword(s) that you enter. \</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230402.xhp	0	help	par_id3163820				0	hr	You can also use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100000.xhp\" name=\"regular expressions\"\>regular expressions\</link\> (wildcards) when you filter the comments.				20181231 09:50:43
