helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	hr	This section contains information on browsing and editing database tables.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149150				0	hr	You cannot use the data source browser on a database table that is open in Design view.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149235				0	hr	Data source browser				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TLB_TREELISTBOX\"\>The commands for the data source browser are found on the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340400.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Table Data bar\</link\> and in \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340400.xhp\" name=\"context menus\"\>context menus\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154514				0	hr	Selecting records				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	hr	To select a record in a database table, click the row header, or click a row header, and then use the Up or Down arrow keys.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id7812433001				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select database records. Drag-and-drop rows or cells to the document to insert contents. Drag-and-drop column headers to insert fields.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
