helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146913				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TLB_TREELISTBOX\"\>Inserts a new record into the current table.\</ahelp\>To create a record, click the asterisk (*) button at the bottom of the table view. An empty row is added at the end of the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150656				0	hr	Number of records				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148483				0	hr	The Form Navigation bar also displays information about the number of records in the current table. For example, "Record 7 of 9(2)" indicates that two records (2) are selected in a table containing 9 records, and that the cursor is in record number 7.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151357				0	hr	Organizing tables				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153357				0	hr	To access the commands for formatting the table, right-click a column header, or a row header.				20181231 09:50:43
