helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159148				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CONFIGFUNCTION_ACC_LISTBOX\"\>Select a function that you want to assign a shortcut key to, click a key combination in the \<emph\>Shortcut keys\</emph\> list, and then click \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. If the selected function already has a shortcut key, it is displayed in the \<emph\>Keys \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
