helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	hr	To export a range of pages, use the format 3-6. To export single pages, use the format 7;9;11. If you want, you can export a combination of page ranges and single pages, by using a format like 3-6;8;10;12.				20181231 09:50:43
