helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	hr	The following capitalization effects are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	hr	Without - no effect is applied				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154280				0	hr	Capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947				0	hr	Lowercase - changes the selected uppercase characters to lower characters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	hr	Title font - changes the first character of each selected word to an uppercase character				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154937				0	hr	Small capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters, and then reduces their size				20181231 09:50:43
