helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id0523200810573866				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable or disable the extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
