helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id4453566				0	hr	Updates				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4129459				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to check for online updates of all installed extensions. To check for updates of the selected extensions only, choose the Update command from the context menu. The check for availability of updates starts immediately.\</ahelp\> You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/extensionupdate.xhp\"\>Extension Update\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id4921414				0	hr	Odrednice				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id1439558				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select an installed extension, then click to open the Options dialog for the extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id0103201110331832				0	hr	Some additional commands can appear in the context menu of an extension in the Extension Manager window, depending on the selected extension. You can choose to show the license text again. You can choose to exclude the extension from checking for updates or to include an excluded extension.				20181231 09:50:43
