helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230401.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511	26			0	hr	The \<emph\>List \</emph\>tab displays all of the changes that were recorded in the current document. If you want to filter this list, click the \<emph\>Filter \</emph\>tab, and then select your \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230402.xhp\" name=\"filter criteria\"\>filter criteria\</link\>.\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\> If the list contains nested changes, the dependencies are shown regardless of the filter.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
