helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535	2			0	hr	Dragging-and-dropping a query or table opens the \<emph\>Copy Table \</emph\>dialog, which allows you to define the options for copying a query or a table.				20181231 09:50:43
