helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	hr	use the structure of the table as the basis for creating a new table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	hr	You can copy within the same database or between different databases.				20181231 09:50:43
