helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149264	29			0	hr	You can copy a table by dragging and dropping the table onto the table area of a database file window. The \<emph\>Copy table \</emph\>dialog appears.				20181231 09:50:43
