helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menuedit.xhp	0	help	par_idN10580				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Renames the selected object. Depending on the database, some names, characters, and name length might be invalid.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
