helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	hr	Select the tables that you want to filter in the \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	hr	If you select the topmost table in a hierarchy, all of the tables in the hierarchy are selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	hr	If you select a table that is at a lower level in the hierarchy, the tables that occur above it in the hierarchy are not selected.				20181231 09:50:43
