helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154015				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>links;relational databases (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inner joins (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>joins in databases (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>left joins (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>right joins (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>full joins (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154015				0	hr	Relacije				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151205				0	hr	If you double-click a connection between two linked fields in the query design, or if you choose \<emph\>Insert - New Relation\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Relations\</emph\> dialog appears. These properties will be used in all queries created in the future.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155066				0	hr	Uključene tablice				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153924				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_RIGHT_TABLE\"\>Specifies two different tables that you want to join.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	hr	Uključena polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148994				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies two data fields that will be joined by a relation.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
