helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropadd.xhp	0	help	par_idN10651				0	hr	Text and dBase databases are restricted to character sets with a fixed-size character length, where all characters are encoded with the same number of bytes.				20181231 09:50:43
