helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Prevents an unauthorized user from accessing the database. You only need to enter the password once per session.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
