helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_INDEXLIST\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays the available indexes. Select an index from the list to edit.\</ahelp\> The corresponding details of the selected index are then visible on the right side of the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149795				0	hr	Novi indeks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150085				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_NEWINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Creates a new index.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
