helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_DROPINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Deletes the current index.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150986				0	hr	Preimenuj trenutni indeks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_RENAMEINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Renames the current index.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153628				0	hr	Spremi trenutni indeks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_SAVEINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Saves the current index in the data source.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154924				0	hr	Poništi trenutni indeks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_RESETINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Resets the current index to the setting that it had when the dialog was started.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	hr	Detalji indeksa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938	16			0	hr	As soon as you change a detail of the current index and then select another index, the change is immediately passed to the data source. You can only leave the dialog, or select another index, if the change has been successfully acknowledged by the data source. However, you can undo the change by clicking  the \<emph\>Reset Current Index \</emph\>icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154138				0	hr	Jedinstven				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282	18			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_CHECKBOX_DLG_INDEXDESIGN_CB_UNIQUE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies whether the current index allows only unique values.\</ahelp\> Checking the \<emph\>Unique \</emph\>option prevents duplicate data from being entered in the field and ensures data integrity.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	hr	Polja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085	20			0	hr	The\<emph\> Fields\</emph\> area displays a list of fields in the current table. You can also select multiple fields. In order to remove a field from the selection, select the empty entry at the start of the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149765				0	hr	Polje indeksa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158408				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGINDEX_INDEXDETAILS_FIELD\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays the a list fields in the current table. You can select more than one field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153192				0	hr	Redoslijed pri razvrstavanju				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGINDEX_INDEXDETAILS_SORTORDER\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Determines the sort order.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
