helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Table Design\</emph\> window you define new tables or edit the structure of a table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	hr	The window has its own menu bar. It also contains the following new command: \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05010100.xhp\" name=\"Index Design\"\>\<emph\>Index Design\</emph\>\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
