helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148668				0	hr	\<variable id=\"formularentwurf\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Form Design\"\>Form Design\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	hr	Any $[officename] document can be expanded into a form. Simply add one or more form controls.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	hr	Open the Form Controls toolbar. The Form Controls toolbar contains the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>functions\</link\> needed to edit a form. More functions can be found in the \<emph\>Form Design\</emph\> bar and \<emph\>More Controls\</emph\> bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	hr	In the form design you can \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"include controls\"\>include controls\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"apply properties\"\>apply properties\</link\> to them, define \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form properties\"\>Form properties\</link\>, and \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"define subforms\"\>define subforms\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154924	9			0	hr	The\<emph\> Form Navigator\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156002\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_showfmexplorer.png\" width=\"4.23mm\" height=\"4.23mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156002\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the Form Object bar opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	6			0	hr	The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171000.xhp\" name=\"Open in Design Mode\"\>\<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id1871395\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_openreadonly.png\" width=\"5.59mm\" height=\"5.59mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1871395\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> allows you to save a form document so that it always opens in editing mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	hr	If there is an error when assigning properties to the objects contained in the form (for example, when assigning a non-existent database table to an object), a corresponding error message appears. This error message may contain a \<emph\>More\</emph\> button. \<ahelp hid=\"dummy\"\>If you click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, a dialog displaying more information about the current problem appears.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Create New Adabas Database				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159176				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30100000.xhp\" name=\"Create New Adabas Database\"\>Create New Adabas Database\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154515				0	hr	Creates a new \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30000000.xhp\" name=\"Adabas database\"\>Adabas database\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156117				0	hr	Naziv baze podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DBNAME\"\>Type the name of the database.\</ahelp\> The name is added to the \<emph\>Data source URL\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150256				0	hr	Korisnikove postavke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	hr	Administrator				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSUSR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the name of the database administrator.\</ahelp\> The administrator name and password is assigned when you create an Adabas database. Apart from the administrator, two more users can access the Adabas database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149045				0	hr	Control User				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_CONUSR\"\>Enter the name of a user that you want to give limited control to modify some parameters of the database. Normally, the default settings for the name and the password of the control user are not changed.\</ahelp\> The control user does not affect the three-user limitation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379				0	hr	Domain User				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153362				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_USR\"\>Enter the name of the domain user that is used by Adabas internally. Normally, the default settings for the name and password of the domain user are not changed.\</ahelp\> The domain user does not affect the three-user limit.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147084				0	hr	Lozinka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148674				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DOMAINPWD\"\>Enter a password.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144433				0	hr	Postavke baze podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	hr	Drives containing parts of the Serverdb are called DEVSPACEs. To improve performance, store each DEVSPACE on separate drives.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	hr	The file path for a DEVSPACE, including its file name, cannot exceed 40 characters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146148				0	hr	SYSDEVSPACE				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSDEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the system DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> The SYSDEVSPACE manages the configuration data for the database. The size of the SYSDEVSPACE depends on the size of the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147319				0	hr	TRANSACTIONLOG				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_TRANSACTIONLOG\"\>Enter the path for the transaction log file.\</ahelp\> This file records all modifications that are made to the database during a transaction, and overwrites them when the transaction is completed. The TRANSACTIONLOG is also used for the rollback of a transaction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	hr	DATADEVSPACE				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the data DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> This file stores user data, such as tables and indexes, as well as the SQL catalog (schema info). The data contained in one user table is evenly distributed across all DATADEVSPACEs. The combined size of all DATADEVSPACEs corresponds to the size of the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	hr	The maximum size for a DATADEVSPACE in the limited version Adabas database is 100MB.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	hr	If the DATADEVSPACE reaches full capacity during a database operation, Adabas shuts down, increases the capacity of the DATADEVSPACE (up to 100 MB), and restarts the database. Saved data is not lost.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153189				0	hr	...				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153091				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_PBDATADEVSPACE\"\>Locate the directory where you want to save the file, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150686				0	hr	Transaction file (MB)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_TRANSACTIONLOG_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the transaction file in megabytes.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157977				0	hr	Veličina baze podataka (MB)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150115				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the database in megabytes here. The maximum size is 100 MB.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155415				0	hr	Data buffer size (MB)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149378	31			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_CACHE_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the data cache in megabytes. \</ahelp\> The data buffer can be simultaneously accessed by all users and stores the most recently accessed pages from the DATADEVSPACEs.				20181231 09:50:43
