helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_id3783989				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When you enter a new record or update an existing record in a form, and you leave a field empty which is bound to a database column which requires input, then you will see a message complaining about the empty field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_id6684163				0	hr	If this control box is not enabled, then the forms in the current database will not be checked for required fields.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_id3837397				0	hr	The control box is available for all data source types which support write access to their data. The control box does not exist for spreadsheets, text, csv, and the various read-only address books.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	hd_id0909200811170166				0	hr	Ignore currency field information				20181231 09:50:43
