helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091600.xhp	0	help	par_id3109794				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_DOTSUP\"\>This icon inserts an upward diagonal ellipsis (three dots on the diagonal from the bottom left to the top right)\</ahelp\>Command for the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window: \<emph\>dotsup\</emph\> or \<emph\>dotsdiag\</emph\>				20181231 09:50:43
