helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155374				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FUNCTIONS_CAT\"\>Choose a function in the lower part of the window.\</ahelp\> These functions are also listed in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. Any functions not contained in the Selection window need to be typed manually in the Commands window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150760				0	hr	The following is a list of all functions that appear in the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> window. The icon next to the function indicates that it can be accessed through the Selection window (menu View - Selection) or through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
