helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228				0	hr	Use the \<emph\>Category\</emph\> button to determine the formula element for which you would like to specify the spacing. The appearance of the dialog depends on the selected category. A preview window shows you which spacing is modified through the respective boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
