helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153354				0	hr	Note that all n here have different sizes. The size 1.333 results from 8/6, the desired size divided by the default index size 6. (Index size 50% with a base size of 12)				20181231 09:50:43
