helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_ZOOMIN\"\>Increases the display scale of the formula by 25%.\</ahelp\> The zoom scale is displayed on the status bar. You can also change the scale in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the status bar. The workspace context menu contains zoom options as well.				20181231 09:50:43
