helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149500				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TOOLBOX\"\>This is a list of operators, functions, symbols and format options that can be inserted into the formula.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	hr	Some \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03090900.xhp\" name=\"examples\"\>examples\</link\> show you the range of operations. You can find more examples in the \<emph\>Samples - Formulas\</emph\> folder.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	hr	The selection window is divided into two parts. Clicking a symbol at the top of the window displays its subordinate symbols in the lower half of the window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	hr	You can access the same functions in submenus through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
