helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313				0	hr	\<variable id=\"symboletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_SYMBOLS_CATALOGUE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Symbols\</emph\> dialog, in which you can select a symbol to insert in the formula.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150202				0	hr	Symbol Set				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMBOLDIALOG_1\"\>All symbols are organized into symbol sets. Select the desired symbol set from the list box. The corresponding group of symbols appear in the field below.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917				0	hr	When a symbol is selected, its command name appears below the symbol list and a magnified version appears in a box to the right. Note that the name must be typed in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window exactly as displayed here (case-sensitive).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126	3			0	hr	To insert a symbol, select it from the list and click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. The corresponding command name appears in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. 				20181231 09:50:43
