helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	hd_id966216				0	hr	\<variable id=\"type_stock\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_stock.xhp\"\>Chart Type Stock\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	par_id3516953				0	hr	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	hd_id5268410				0	hr	Gomila				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	par_id61342				0	hr	A Stock chart illustrates the market trend given by opening price, bottom price, top price and closing price. The transaction volume can also be shown.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	par_id2131412				0	hr	For a Stock chart the order of the data series is important. The data should be arranged as shown in the example table below.				20181231 09:50:43
