helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id4309518				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id206610				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6917020				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9969481				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the secondary x-axis. This option is only available for charts that support a secondary x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id816675				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the secondary y-axis. This option is only available for charts that support a secondary y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id4411145				0	hr	To enter chart elements				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3274941				0	hr	Enter titles or click the elements that you want to be shown on the current chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id9804681				0	hr	Titles				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3614917				0	hr	If you enter text for a title, subtitle, or any axis, the necessary space will be reserved to display the text next to the chart. If you do not enter a text, no space will be reserved, leaving more space to display the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id156865				0	hr	It is not possible to link the title text to a cell. You must enter the text directly.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6034424				0	hr	When the chart is finished, you can change the position and other properties by the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> menu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9033783				0	hr	Legenda				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id1069368				0	hr	The legend displays the labels from the first row or column, or from the range that you have set in the Data Series dialog. If your chart does not contain labels, the legend displays text like "Row 1, Row 2, ...", or "Column A, Column B, ..." according to the row number or column letter of the chart data.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	hr	You cannot enter the text directly, it is automatically generated from the Name cell range.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id71413				0	hr	Select one of the position options. When the chart is finished, you can specify other positions using the Format menu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id4776757				0	hr	Mreže				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6737876				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are parallel to the x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id1058992				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are parallel to the y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id7366557				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are parallel to the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6527298				0	hr	The visible grid lines can help to estimate the data values in the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	hr	The distance of the grid lines corresponds to the interval settings in the Scale tab of the axis properties.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	hr	Grid lines are not available for pie charts.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id6942045				0	hr	Additional elements				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	hr	For additional elements use the Insert menu of the chart in edit mode. There you can define the following elements:				20181231 09:50:43
