helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3150476				0	hr	You can also add fields, such as the date or page number, to a header or footer by choosing \<emph\>Insert - Fields\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3156320	18			0	hr	You can hide the header or footer on the current slide by choosing \<emph\>Format\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"Modify Layout\"\>Slide\<emph\> Layout\</emph\>\</link\>, and clearing the \<emph\>Objects on background\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
