helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150717				0	hr	\<variable id=\"text2curve\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/text2curve.xhp\" name=\"Converting Text Characters into Drawing Objects\"\>Converting Text Characters into Drawing Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3155960				0	hr	You can convert text characters into curves that you can edit and resize as you would any drawing object. Once you convert text into a drawing object, you can no longer edit the content of the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153965				0	hr	To convert text into a drawing object:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3146963				0	hr	Select the text that you want to convert, and do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	hr	In $[officename] Draw, choose \<emph\>Modify - Convert - To Curve\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150395				0	hr	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the border of the text object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Curve\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746				0	hr	If your text contains more than one character, the converted text becomes a grouped object. Double-click the group to edit individual objects. Press Esc when finished.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150336				0	hr	Now, click the \<emph\>Points\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. Click the object. You can see all the Bézier points of the object. On the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> bar, you can find various icons for editing, inserting and deleting points.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Changing the Slide Background Fill				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150199				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds; changing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slide masters; changing backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slides;changing backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150199	33			0	hr	\<variable id=\"background\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/background.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Slide Background Fill\"\>Changing the Slide Background Fill\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155067				0	hr	You can change the background color or the background fill of the current slide or all of the slides in your document. For a background fill, you can use hatching, a gradient, or a bitmap image.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148701				0	hr	If you want to change the background fill for all of the slides, choose \<emph\>View - Master - Slide Master\</emph\>. To change the background fill of a single slide, choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id624713				0	hr	            \<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click Set Background Picture for Slide in the context menu of a slide in Normal view to select a bitmap file. This file is used as a background picture.\</ahelp\>        				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150534				0	hr	To use a color, gradient, or hatching pattern for the slide background				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149942				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click on the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148725	51			0	hr	In the \<emph\>Fill \</emph\>area, do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153040				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Color\</emph\>, and then click a color in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150866				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Gradient\</emph\>, and then click a gradient style in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150338				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Hatching\</emph\>, and then click a hatching style in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150021				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145244				0	hr	To use an image for the slide background				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	hr	You can display an entire image as a slide background, or you can tile the image to produce a patterned background.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3156064				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click on the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3145356	59			0	hr	In the \<emph\>Fill \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Bitmap\</emph\>, and then click an image in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150757	60			0	hr	If you want to use a custom image for the slide background, close the \<emph\>Page Setup \</emph\>dialog, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>. Click the \<emph\>Bitmaps \</emph\>tab, and then click \<emph\>Import\</emph\>. Locate the image you want to import and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>. When you return to the \<emph\>Background \</emph\>tab, the image you imported will be in the \<emph\>Bitmap \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153151				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150263	62			0	hr	To display the entire image as the background, clear the \<emph\>Tile \</emph\>check box in the \<emph\>Position \</emph\>area, and then select \<emph\>AutoFit\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	hr	To tile the image on the background, select \<emph\>Tile\</emph\>, and set the \<emph\>Size\</emph\>, \<emph\>Position\</emph\>, and \<emph\>Offset\</emph\> options for the image.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154934				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3158403				0	hr	This modification is only valid for the current presentation document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	hr	To save a new slide master as a template				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10827				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>View - Master - Slide Master\</emph\> to change the slide master.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\> to change the slide background, or choose other formatting commands. Add objects that will be visible on all slides.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\> to close the master view.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\> to save the document as a template.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10847				0	hr	Enter a name for the template. Do not change the category from "My Templates". Click OK.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084A				0	hr	Now you can use the Presentation Wizard to open a new presentation based on your new template.				20181231 09:50:43
