helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	hd_id2476577				0	hr	To apply and edit a motion path effect:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id4217047				0	hr	An object can be animated to move along a motion path. You can use predefined or your own motion paths.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id2629474				0	hr	If you select "Curve", "Polygon", or "Freeform Line", the dialog closes and you can draw your own path. If the drawing is finished and not canceled, the created path is removed from the document and inserted as a motion path effect.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id8069704				0	hr	 \<emph\>Editing motion paths\</emph\> 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id4524674				0	hr	If the Custom Animation Panel is visible, the motion paths of all effects of the current slide are drawn as a transparent overlay on the slide. All paths are visible all the time, therefore animations with consecutive paths can be created easily. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id4396801				0	hr	A motion path can be selected by clicking on the path. A selected path will support handles, it can be moved and resized like a shape. A double click on a path starts the point edit mode. The point edit mode can also be started by \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Points\</item\> or by pressing \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F8\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148387				0	hr	To remove an animation effect from an object:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3148774				0	hr	On a slide in \<emph\>Normal\</emph\> view, select the object from which to remove the effect.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3155372				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Animation\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3153718				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layer_new.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Umetanje Slojeva 				20181231 09:50:43
