helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3146125				0	hr	To edit the properties of the 3D object, use the Line and Filling toolbar and the 3D Settings toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149336				0	hr	You can rotate the 2D object before converting it to create a more complex shape.				20181231 09:50:43
