helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Creating Animated GIF Images				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153188				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>cross-fading; creating cross-fades\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>GIF images; animating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>animated GIFs\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153188				0	hr	\<variable id=\"animated_gif_create\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/animated_gif_create.xhp\" name=\"Creating Animated GIF Images\"\>Creating Animated GIF Images\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377				0	hr	You can animate drawing objects, text objects, and graphic objects (images) on your slides to make your presentation more interesting. $[officename] Impress provides you with a simple animation editor where you can create animation images (frames) by assembling objects from your slide. The animation effect is achieved by rotating through the static frames that you create.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3154657				0	hr	If you create a bitmap animation (animated GIF), you can assign a delay time to each frame, and specify the number of times the animation is played.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150250				0	hr	To create an animated GIF:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3148703	59			0	hr	Select an object or group of objects that you want to include in your animation and choose\<emph\> Insert - Animated Image\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149601				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3145086	97			0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Apply Object \</emph\>button \<image id=\"img_id3148489\" src=\"sd/res/get1obj.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148489\"\>Note Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to add a single object or a group of objects to the current animation frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3150860	98			0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Apply Objects Individually \</emph\>button \<image id=\"img_id3149355\" src=\"sd/res/getallob.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149355\"\>Tip Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to create a separate animation frame for each of the selected objects.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3148391	61			0	hr	In the \<emph\>Animation Group \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Bitmap object\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3154871				0	hr	Use the animation timeline to specify the duration for displaying a frame and the number of times an animation sequence is presented (looping).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3154644				0	hr	Enter a frame number in the \<emph\>Image Number\</emph\> box (left box).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756	63			0	hr	Enter the number of seconds you want the frame to display in the \<emph\>Duration \</emph\>box (middle box).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3151182				0	hr	Repeat the last two steps for each frame in your animation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177	100			0	hr	You can preview your animation by using the controls to the left of the \<emph\>Image Number \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939	65			0	hr	Select the number of times you want the animation sequence to repeat in the \<emph\>Loop count \</emph\>box (right box).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3145421				0	hr	Select an alignment option for the objects in the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
