helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3148826	49			0	hr	If you want, you can use the \<emph\>Zoom\</emph\> toolbar \<image id=\"img_id3151172\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_zoom.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151172\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to change the view magnification for the slides.				20181231 09:50:43
