helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633				0	hr	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	hr	Select the bitmap image that you want to convert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	hr	In $[officename] Draw, choose \<emph\>Modify - Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	hr	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3149349				0	hr	Set the conversion options for the image, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. See \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050200.xhp\" name=\"Convert to Polygon\"\>\<emph\>Convert to Polygon\</emph\>\</link\> for a description of the conversion options.				20181231 09:50:43
