helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152596				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>slide designs\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slide masters; designing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds; slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>master pages, see slide masters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slides; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	hr	\<variable id=\"masterpage\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/masterpage.xhp\" name=\"Applying a Slide Design to a Master Slide\"\>Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	hr	Every slide in a presentation has exactly one slide master, also known as master page. A slide master determines the text formatting style for the title and outline and the background design for all slides that use this slide master.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	hr	To apply a new slide master				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Format - Slide Design\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148485				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Load\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	hr	Under \<emph\>Categories\</emph\>, select a slide design category.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915	26			0	hr	Under \<emph\>Templates\</emph\>, select a template with the design that you want to apply. To preview the template, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Preview \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154652				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436				0	hr	To apply the slide design to all of the slides in your presentation, select the \<emph\>Exchange background page\</emph\> check box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	hr	To apply the slide design to the current slide only, clear the \<emph\>Exchange background page\</emph\> check box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3149941				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Ponovi  				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145253				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>presentations;rehearse timings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rehearse timings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>timings; rehearse timings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>automatic slide changes;rehearse timings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>recording;display times for slides\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253				0	hr	\<variable id=\"rehearse_timings\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/rehearse_timings.xhp\" name=\"Rehearse Timings of Slide Changes\"\>Rehearse Timings of Slide Changes\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3155446	1			0	hr	$[officename] assists you in defining the right rehearse timings for automatic slide changes. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	hr	Prepare the slides, start the show using a special icon, tell your imaginary audience what you want to tell for the first slide, then advance to the next slide and so on. $[officename] records the display time for each slide, so the next time you play the show with automatic slide changes, the timing will be as recorded.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146317				0	hr	To record a show with rehearse timings				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	hr	Open a presentation, and switch to \<emph\>Slide Sorter\</emph\> View.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3150651	6			0	hr	Start the show with the \<emph\>Rehearse Timings\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156396\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_rehearsetimings.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156396\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the Slide View bar. You see the first slide and a timer in the bottom corner.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	hr	When it's time to advance to the next slide, click the timer. To keep the default setting for this slide, click the slide, but not the timer. Continue for all slides in your presentation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3150333				0	hr	$[officename] has recorded the display time for each slide. Save your presentation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248				0	hr	If you want the whole presentation to auto-repeat, open the menu \<emph\>Slide Show - Slide Show Settings\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Auto\</emph\> and \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Slide Show Settings\"\>Slide Show Settings\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
