helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	hr	\<variable id=\"orgchart\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/orgchart.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Flowchart\"\>Creating a Flowchart\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	hr	To create a flowchart:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	hr	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	hr	Drag a shape in your slide.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	hr	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	hr	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	hr	Move the pointer over the edge of a shape so that the connection sites appear.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146871				0	hr	Click a connection site, drag to a connection site on another shape, and then release.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	hr	To add more connectors, repeat the last steps.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153036				0	hr	You now have the basic outline for your flowchart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155255				0	hr	To add text to the shapes on your flowchart				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150865				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145592				0	hr	Double-click the shape, and type or paste your text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and drag a text object over the shape. Type or paste your text into the text object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153730				0	hr	To add a color fill to a shape:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930				0	hr	Select the shape, and choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145348				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Color\</emph\>, and then click a color in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150934				0	hr	To add some hot spots that call other slides:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145300	57			0	hr	Assign \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06070000.xhp\" name=\"interactions\"\>interactions\</link\> to some objects on your slide. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_idN10898				0	hr	Select the object, then choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Interaction\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A0				0	hr	Select an interaction in the dialog. For example, select to go to the next slide when the user clicks the object.				20181231 09:50:43
