helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871				0	hr	The CMYK list is optimized for print colors, whereas the colors in the Web and the HTML lists are optimized for displays using a resolution of 256 colors.				20181231 09:50:43
