helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id6086611				0	hr	Multiple Monitors				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id5446943				0	hr	By default the primary monitor is used for slide show mode. If the current desktop is displayed on more than one monitor, you can select which monitor to use for full screen slide show mode. If the current desktop spans only one monitor, or if the multi monitor feature is not supported on the current system, you cannot select another monitor.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id4962309				0	hr	Presentation Monitor				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id5168919				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a monitor to use for full screen slide show mode.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id4846339				0	hr	If the system allows to span a window over all available monitors, you can also select "All monitors". In this case the presentation spans over all available monitors. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id2321543				0	hr	This setting is saved in the user configuration and not inside the document.				20181231 09:50:43
