helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	hr	Specifies the timing for the current effect in the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	hr	Pokreni				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066F				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"878841346\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10675				0	hr	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	hr	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10683				0	hr	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20181231 09:50:43
