helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	hr	Zbroj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	hr	$[officename] automatically suggests a cell range, provided that the spreadsheet contains data. If the cell range already contains a sum function, you can combine it with the new one to yield the total sum of the range. If the range contains filters, the Subtotal function is inserted instead of the Sum function.				20181231 09:50:43
