helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099A				0	hr	Scaling factor				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152899				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_METRICFIELD_RID_SCPAGE_TABLE_ED_SCALEALL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a scaling factor. Factors less than 100 reduce the pages, higher factors enlarge the pages.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B2				0	hr	Stisni raspon ispisa u visinu/širinu				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B5				0	hr	Specifies the maximum number of pages horizontally (width) and vertically (height) on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BB				0	hr	The print ranges are always scaled proportionally, so the resulting number of pages may be less than specified.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BF				0	hr	You may clear one of the boxes, then the unspecified dimension will use as many pages as necessary.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C3				0	hr	If you clear both boxes, this will result in a scaling factor of 100%.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CE				0	hr	Width in pages				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D1				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:NumericField:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:ED_SCALEPAGEWIDTH\"\>Enter the maximum number of pages to be printed horizontally across.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E8				0	hr	Height in pages				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109EB				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:NumericField:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:ED_SCALEPAGEHEIGHT\"\>Enter the maximum number of pages to be printed vertically stacked.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868				0	hr	Smanji raspon ispisa na broj stranica				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145074				0	hr	Specifies the maximum number of pages on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. The scale will be reduced as necessary to fit the defined number of pages.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	hr	Broj stranica				20181231 09:50:43
