helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillLeft\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the far right cell.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	hr	If a selected range has only one row, the content of the far right cell is copied into all other cells of the range. If several rows are selected, the far right cells are copied into the cells to the left.				20181231 09:50:43
