helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_APPEND_NAME\"\>Enter a new name for the sheet here.\</ahelp\> Allowed characters are letters, numbers, spaces, and the underline character.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153092	5			0	hr	You can also open the\<emph\> Rename Sheet \</emph\>dialog through the context menu by positioning the mouse pointer over a sheet tab at the bottom of the window and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>clicking while pressing Ctrl \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>clicking the right mouse button\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	hr	Alternatively, click the sheet tab while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key. Now you can change the name directly. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\<embedvar href=\"text/shared/00/00000099.xhp#winmanager\"/\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
