helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	hr	Use the Styles and Formatting window to assign styles to objects and text sections. You can update Styles, modify existing Styles or create new Styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	hr	The Styles and Formatting \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\> can remain open while editing the document.				20181231 09:50:43
