helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157909				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Recalculate\"\>Recalculate\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Calculate\"\>Recalculates the current sheet manually. Use this command to update all calculations in the document if you have deselected the automatic recalculation function, and also to update the NOW() function.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475899				0	hr	Press F9 to recalculate. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	hr	After the document has been recalculated, the display is refreshed. Any charts contained in the sheet are also refreshed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475855				0	hr	The Add-In functions like RANDBETWEEN currently cannot respond to the Recalculate command or F9. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas, including the Add-In functions.				20181231 09:50:43
