helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3151113				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_PIVOTSUBT\"\>Specify the subtotals that you want to calculate.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
