helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148728				0	hr	To calculate the intercept, use cells D3:D9 as the y value and C3:C9 as the x value from the example spreadsheet. Input will be as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3149013	11			0	hr	INTERCEPT(D3:D9;C3:C9) = 2.15. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148437				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>COUNT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbers;counting\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
