helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3149953				0	hr	The entries \<emph\>2, 4, 6\</emph\> and \<emph\>eight\</emph\> in the \<emph\>value 1 - 4\</emph\> fields are to be counted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558	20			0	hr	COUNT(2;4;6;"eight") = 3. The count of numbers is therefore \<emph\>3\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149729				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>COUNTA function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>number of entries\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
