helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154508				0	hr	The entries \<emph\>2, 4, 6\</emph\> and \<emph\>eight\</emph\> in the \<emph\>value 1 - 4\</emph\> fields are to be counted.				20181231 09:50:43
