helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150267				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>B function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>probabilities of samples with binomial distribution\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
