helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_B\"\>Returns the probability of a sample with binomial distribution.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
