helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156306	58			0	hr	\<emph\>Beta\</emph\> is a parameter to the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960	59			0	hr	\<emph\>Start\</emph\> (optional) is the lower bound for \<emph\>number\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3151268	60			0	hr	\<emph\>End\</emph\> (optional) is the upper bound for \<emph\>number\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_idN109DF				0	hr	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
