helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156107	69			0	hr	\<emph\>Alpha\</emph\> is a parameter to the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3153619	70			0	hr	\<emph\>Beta\</emph\> is a parameter to the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
