helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id012020091254453				0	hr	            \<emph\>Cumulative\</emph\> (optional) can be 0 or False to calculate the probability density function. It can be any other value or True or omitted to calculate the cumulative distribution function.				20181231 09:50:43
