helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155516				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>NORMINV function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>normal distribution;inverse of\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
