helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3156295				0	hr	\<emph\>STDEV\</emph\> is the standard deviation of the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145080				0	hr	\<emph\>C\</emph\> = 0 calculates the density function; \<emph\>C\</emph\> = 1 calculates the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
