helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3158411				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KUMZINSZ\"\>Calculates the cumulative interest payments, that is, the total interest, for an investment based on a constant interest rate.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
