helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_CUMIPMT\"\>Calculates the accumulated interest for a period.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
