helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153210				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_PRICE\"\>Calculates the market value of a fixed interest security with a par value of 100 currency units as a function of the forecast yield.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154646				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152804				0	hr	PRICE(Settlement;Maturity;Rate;Yield;Redemption;Frequency;Basis)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156121				0	hr	Settlement: the date of purchase of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	hr	Maturity: the date on which the security matures (expires).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153755				0	hr	Rate: the annual nominal rate of interest (coupon interest rate)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155999				0	hr	Yield: the annual yield of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	hr	Redemption: the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155846				0	hr	Frequency: number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153148				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150260				0	hr	A security is purchased on 2/15/1999; the maturity date is 11/15/2007. The nominal rate of interest is 5.75%. The yield is 6.5%. The redemption value is 100 currency units. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). With calculation on basis 0 the price is as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147273				0	hr	=PRICE("2/15/1999"; "11/15/2007"; 0.0575; 0.065; 100; 2; 0) returns 95.04287.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151297				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>PRICEDISC function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>prices;non-interest-bearing securities\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sales values;non-interest-bearing securities\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
