helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154304				0	hr	Maturity: the date on which the security matures (expires).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156014				0	hr	Discount: the discount of a security as a percentage.				20181231 09:50:43
