helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149198				0	hr	A security is purchased on 2/15/1999; the maturity date is 3/1/1999. Discount in per cent is 5.25%. The redemption value is 100. When calculating on basis 2 the price discount is as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151178				0	hr	=PRICEDISC("2/15/1999"; "3/1/1999"; 0.0525; 100; 2) returns 99.79583.				20181231 09:50:43
