helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145308				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NBW\"\>Returns the present value of an investment based on a series of periodic cash flows and a discount rate. To get the net present value, subtract the cost of the project (the initial cash flow at time zero) from the returned value.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149937				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153321				0	hr	NPV(RATE;Value 1;Value 2;...)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150630				0	hr	RATE: the discount rate for a period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150427				0	hr	Value1;... are up to 30 values, which represent deposits or withdrawals.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153538				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154800				0	hr	What is the net present value of periodic payments of 10, 20 and 30 currency units with a discount rate of 8.75%. At time zero the costs were paid as -40 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	hr	NPV(8.75%;10;20;30) = 49.43 u novčanim jedinicama. Netto prezentirana vrijednost je vraćena vrijednost minus početni trošak od 40 jedinica, znači 9.43 novčane jedinice.				20181231 09:50:43
