helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147091				0	hr	What is the nominal interest per year for an effective interest rate of 13.5% if twelve payments are made per year.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	hr	NOMINAL(13.5%;12) = 12.73%. The nominal interest rate per year is 12.73%.				20181231 09:50:43
