helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	hr	What is the nominal rate of interest for a 5.3543% effective rate of interest and quarterly payment.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	hr	=NOMINAL_ADD(5.3543%; 4) returns 0.0525 or 5.25%.				20181231 09:50:43
