helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154194				0	hr	=YIELD("2/15/1999"; "11/15/2007"; 0.0575 ;95.04287; 100; 2; 0) returns 0.065 or 6.5 per cent.				20181231 09:50:43
