helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154139				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3163815				0	hr	A non-interest-bearing security is purchased on 2/15/1999. It matures on 3/1/1999. The price is 99.795 currency units per 100 units of par value, the redemption value is 100 units. The basis is 2. How high is the yield?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155187				0	hr	=YIELDDISC("2/15/1999"; "3/1/1999"; 99.795; 100; 2) returns 0.052823 or 5.2823 per cent.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155140				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>YIELDMAT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rates of return;securities with interest paid on maturity\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
