helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_YIELDMAT\"\>Calculates the annual yield of a security, the interest of which is paid on the date of maturity.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159100				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
