helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153520				0	hr	The return on the treasury bill corresponding to a security is worked out as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154382				0	hr	=TBILLEQ("3/31/99";"6/1/99"; 0.0914) vraca 0.094151ili 9.4151 posto.				20181231 09:50:43
