helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_SUBT_GROUP1\"\>Specify the settings for up to three subtotal groups. Each tab has the same layout.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	hr	To insert subtotal values into a table:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	hr	Ensure that the columns of the table have labels.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	4			0	hr	Select the table or the area in the table that you want to calculate subtotals for, and then choose \<emph\>Data – Subtotals\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Group By\</emph\> box, select the column that you want to add the subtotals to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Calculate subtotals for\</emph\> box, select the check boxes for the columns containing the values that you want to subtotal.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Use function\</emph\> box, select the function that you want to use to calculate the subtotals.				20181231 09:50:43
