helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3154904	131			0	hr	=HYPGEOMDIST(2; 2; 90; 100) yields 0.81. If 90 out of 100 pieces of buttered toast fall from the table and hit the floor with the buttered side first, then if 2 pieces of buttered toast are dropped from the table, the probability is 81%, that both will strike buttered side first.				20181231 09:50:43
