helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_DROPMODE_LINK\"\>Creates a link when you drag-and-drop an object from the Navigator into a document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
