helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431				0	hr	To find the standard deviation of the weight for all children of the same age at Joe's birthday party (scroll up, please), enter the following formula in B16:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148411				0	hr	=DSTDEVP(A1:E10;"Weight";A13:E14)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	hr	In row 14, under Age, enter 7, 8, 9, and so on, one after the other. The result is the standard deviation of the weight for all same-aged children whose weight was checked.				20181231 09:50:43
