helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_ARITHMETIC\"\>Creates a linear number series using the defined increment and end value.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149210				0	hr	Rast				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150364				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_GEOMETRIC\"\>Creates a growth series using the defined increment and end value.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149528				0	hr	Datum				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150887				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DATE\"\>Creates a date series using the defined increment and end date.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150202				0	hr	SamoIspuna				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156288				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_AUTOFILL\"\>Forms a series directly in the sheet.\</ahelp\> The AutoFill function takes account of customized lists. For example, by entering \<emph\>January\</emph\> in the first cell, the series is completed using the list defined under \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155811				0	hr	AutoFill tries to complete a value series by using a defined pattern. The series 1,3,5 is automatically completed with 7,9,11,13, and so on. Date and time series are completed accordingly; for example, after 01.01.99 and 15.01.99, an interval of 14 days is used.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148700				0	hr	Unit of Time				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153308				0	hr	In this area you can specify the desired unit of time. This area is only active if the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> option has been chosen in the \<emph\>Series type\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868				0	hr	Dan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148605				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DAY\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series using seven days.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144771				0	hr	Dan u tjednu				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150108				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DAY_OF_WEEK\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series of five day sets.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154957				0	hr	Mjesec				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_MONTH\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to form a series from the names or abbreviations of the months.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152870				0	hr	Godina				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151300				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_YEAR\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series of years.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154762				0	hr	Start Value				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149381				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_START_VALUES\"\>Determines the start value for the series.\</ahelp\> Use numbers, dates or times.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153013				0	hr	End Value				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153487				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_END_VALUES\"\>Determines the end value for the series.\</ahelp\> Use numbers, dates or times.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149312				0	hr	Povećaj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154739				0	hr	The term "increment" denotes the amount by which a given value increases.\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_INCREMENT\"\> Determines the value by which the series of the selected type increases by each step.\</ahelp\> Entries can only be made if the linear, growth or date series types have been selected.				20181231 09:50:43
