helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153838				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_PIVOT_LAYOUT:ED_OUTAREA\"\>Select the area where you want to display the results of the DataPilot table.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155961				0	hr	If the selected area contains data, the DataPilot overwrites the data. To prevent the loss of existing data, let the DataPilot automatically select the area to display the results.				20181231 09:50:43
