helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3691824				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>INFO function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5787224				0	hr	INFO				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1507309				0	hr	Returns specific information about the current working environment. The function receives a single text argument and returns data depending on that parameter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id7693411				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3928952				0	hr	INFO("Type")				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5206762				0	hr	The following table lists the values for the text parameter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Type\</item\> and the return values of the INFO function.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5735953				0	hr	Value for "Type"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8360850				0	hr	Return value				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9648731				0	hr	"osversion"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id908841				0	hr	Always "Windows (32-bit) NT 5.01", for compatibility reasons				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	hr	"system"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9841608				0	hr	The type of the operating system. \<br/\>"WNT" for Microsoft Windows \<br/\>"LINUX" for Linux \<br/\>"SOLARIS" for Solaris				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2701803				0	hr	"release"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	hr	The product release identifier, for example "300m25(Build:9876)"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9200109				0	hr	"numfile"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	hr	Always 1, for compatibility reasons				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5766472				0	hr	"recalc"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	hr	Current formula recalculation mode, either "Automatic" or "Manual" (localized into %PRODUCTNAME language)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1161534				0	hr	Other spreadsheet applications may accept localized values for the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Type\</item\> parameter, but %PRODUCTNAME Calc will only accept the English values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5459456				0	hr	Example				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=INFO("release")\</item\> returns the product release number of the %PRODUCTNAME in use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2873622				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=INFO(D5)\</item\> with cell \<item type=\"literal\"\>D5\</item\> containing a text string \<item type=\"literal\"\>system\</item\> returns the operation system type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155625				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>CURRENT function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	hr	CURRENT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3157975				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_AKTUELL\"\>Calculates the current value of a formula at the actual position.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930				0	hr	CURRENT()				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145629				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5919064				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=1+2+CURRENT()\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8751792				0	hr	The example returns 6. The formula is calculated from left to right as: 1 + 2 equals 3, giving the result to date when CURRENT() is encountered; CURRENT() therefore yields 3, which is added to the original 3 to give 6.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5863826				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=A2+B2+STYLE(IF(CURRENT()>10;”Red”;”Default”))\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id7463911				0	hr	The example returns A2 + B2 (STYLE returns 0 here). If this sum is greater than 10, the style Red is applied to the cell. See the \<emph\>STYLE\</emph\> function for more explanation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id7318643				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>="choo"&CURRENT()\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6019165				0	hr	The example returns choochoo.				20181231 09:50:43
