helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153179				0	hr	If cell A8 contains the formula =SUM(1;2;3) then				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153923				0	hr	FORMULA(A8) returns the text "=SUM(1;2;3)" (without the double quotes).				20181231 09:50:43
