helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	hr	ISREF(C5) returns the result TRUE				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9728072				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF("abcdef")\</item\> returns always FALSE because a text can never be a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2131544				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(4)\</item\> returns FALSE.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id4295480				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(INDIRECT("A6"))\</item\> returns TRUE, because INDIRECT is a function that returns a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3626819				0	hr	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(ADDRESS(1; 1; 2;"Sheet2"))\</item\> returns FALSE, because ADDRESS is a function that returns a text, although it looks like a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
