helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153155				0	hr	ISERROR(value)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	hr	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is or refers to the value to be tested. ISERROR() returns TRUE if there is an error and FALSE if not.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155994				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150256				0	hr	ISERROR(C8) where cell C8 contains =1/0 returns TRUE, because 1/0 is an error.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1889095				0	hr	ISERROR(C9) where cell C9 contains =NA() returns TRUE.				20181231 09:50:43
