helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10637				0	hr	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/guide/scenario.xhp#scenario\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	hr	Ime scenarija				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041	13			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SCENWIN_TOP\"\>Defines the name for the scenario. Use a clear and unique name so you can easily identify the scenario.\</ahelp\> You can also modify a scenario name in the Navigator through the \<emph\>Properties \</emph\>context menu command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153954				0	hr	Komentar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	15			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SCENWIN_BOTTOM\"\>Specifies additional information about the scenario. This information will be displayed in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> when you click the \<emph\>Scenarios\</emph\> icon and select the desired scenario.\</ahelp\> You can also modify this information in the Navigator through the \<emph\>Properties \</emph\>context menu command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145273				0	hr	Postavke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	hr	This section is used to define some of the settings used in the scenario display.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145367				0	hr	Display border				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:LB_COLOR\"\>Highlights the scenario in your table with a border. The color for the border is specified in the field to the right of this option.\</ahelp\> The border will have a title bar displaying the name of the last scenario. The button on the right of the scenario border offers you an overview of all the scenarios in this area, if several have been defined. You can choose any of the scenarios from this list without restrictions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149582				0	hr	Kopiraj unazad 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:CB_TWOWAY\"\>Copies the values of cells that you change into the active scenario. If you do not select this option, the scenario is not changed when you change cell values. The behavior of the \<emph\>Copy back\</emph\> setting depends on the cell protection, the sheet protection, and the \<emph\>Prevent changes\</emph\> settings.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149402				0	hr	Kopiraj cijeli list 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969	23			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:CB_COPYALL\"\>Copies the entire sheet into an additional scenario sheet. \</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075A				0	hr	Spriječi promjene				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075E				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:CheckBox:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:CB_PROTECT\"\>Prevents changes to the active scenario. The behavior of the \<emph\>Copy back\</emph\> setting depends on the cell protection, the sheet protection, and the \<emph\>Prevent changes\</emph\> settings.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10778				0	hr	You can only change the scenario properties if the \<emph\>Prevent changes\</emph\> option is not selected and if the sheet is not protected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	hr	You can only edit cell values if the \<emph\>Prevent changes\</emph\> option is selected, if the \<emph\>Copy back\</emph\> is option is not selected, and if the cells are not protected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078C				0	hr	You can only change scenario cell values and write them back into the scenario if the \<emph\>Prevent changes\</emph\> option is not selected, if the \<emph\>Copy back\</emph\> option is selected, and if the cells are not protected.				20181231 09:50:43
