helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	hr	Use this section if the cell ranges that you want to consolidate contain labels. You only need to select these options if the consolidation ranges contain similar labels and the data arranged is arranged differently.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	hr	Natpisi redaka				20181231 09:50:43
