helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146037				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RKP\"\>This function calculates the adjustment of the entered data as an exponential regression curve (y=b*m^x).\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
