helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166196				0	hr	\<emph\>Linear_Type\</emph\>(Optional). If \<emph\>Linear_Type\</emph\> = 0, then lines will be calculated through the zero point. Otherwise, offset lines will also be calculated. The default is \<emph\>Linear_Type\</emph\> <> 0.				20181231 09:50:43
