helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166231				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166245				0	hr	Select a spreadsheet range in which the trend data will appear. Select the function. Enter the output data or select it with the mouse. Mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> field. click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The trend data calculated from the output data is displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
