helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	hr	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\>\<emph\>!!\</emph\>, the double factorial of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, where \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is an integer greater than or equal to zero.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	hr	For even numbers FACTDOUBLE(n) returns:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	hr	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20181231 09:50:43
