helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	hr	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	hr	FACTDOUBLE(0) returns 1 by definition.				20181231 09:50:43
