helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id7844477				0	hr	FACTDOUBLE(5) returns 15.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	43			0	hr	=FACTDOUBLE(6) returns 48.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id6478469				0	hr	FACTDOUBLE(0) returns 1.				20181231 09:50:43
