helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	hr	COT(PI()/4) returns 1, the cotangent of PI/4 radians.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148986				0	hr	COT(RADIANS(45)) returns 1, the cotangent of 45 degrees.				20181231 09:50:43
