helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152465				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GGT\"\>Returns the greatest common divisor of two or more integers.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2769249				0	hr	The greatest common divisor is the positive largest integer which will divide, without remainder, each of the given integers.				20181231 09:50:43
