helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149340				0	hr	\<emph\>Integer 1 to 30\</emph\> are up to 30 integers whose greatest common divisor is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147317				0	hr	Primjer:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151285				0	hr	GCD(16;32;24) gives the result 8, because 8 is the largest number that can divide 16, 24 and 32 without a remainder.				20181231 09:50:43
