helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3109841				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_LOG\"\>Returns the logarithm of a number to the specified base.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
