helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144732				0	hr	LOG(number; base)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144746				0	hr	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value whose logarithm is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152840				0	hr	\<emph\>Base\</emph\> is the base for the logarithm calculation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152860				0	hr	Primjer:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154429				0	hr	LOG(10; 3) returns the logarithm to base 3 of 10 (approximately 2.0959).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5577562				0	hr	LOG(7^4; 7) returns 4.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154187				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>LOG10 function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>base-10 logarithm\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
