helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159594				0	hr	POWER(4; 3) returns 64, which is 4 to the power of 3.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1614429				0	hr	4^3 also returns 4 to the power of 3.				20181231 09:50:43
