helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153765				0	hr	AMORLINC				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159264				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_AMORLINC\"\>Calculates the amount of depreciation for a settlement period as linear amortization. If the capital asset is purchased during the settlement period, the proportional amount of depreciation is considered.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
