helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3163807	374			0	hr	\<emph\>Date purchased\</emph\>: the date of acquisition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	375			0	hr	\<emph\>First period\</emph\>: the end date of the first settlement period.				20181231 09:50:43
