helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519	339			0	hr	\<emph\>Issue\</emph\>: the issue date of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155376	340			0	hr	\<emph\>First interest\</emph\>: the first interest date of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3166431	341			0	hr	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\>: the date at which the interest accrued up until then is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486	342			0	hr	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\>: the annual nominal rate of interest (coupon interest rate)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156445	343			0	hr	\<emph\>Par\</emph\>: the par value of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149406	344			0	hr	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\>: number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148699				0	hr	Primjer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148599				0	hr	A security is issued on 2.28.2001. First interest is set for 8.31.2001. The settlement date is 5.1.2001. The Rate is 0.1 or 10% and Par is 1000 currency units. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). The basis is the US method (0). How much interest has accrued?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148840	347			0	hr	=ACCRINT("2.28.2001"; "8.31.2001"; "5.1.2001"; 0.1; 1000; 2; 0) returns 16.94444.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151240				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>ACCRINTM function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>accrued interests;one-off payments\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151240				0	hr	ACCRINTM				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3157981				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ACCRINTM\"\>Calculates the accrued interest of a security in the case of one-off payment at the settlement date.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
