helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id1539353				0	hr	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is any number. "Baht" is appended to the integral part of the number, and "Satang" is appended to the decimal part of the number.				20181231 09:50:43
