helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145299	15			0	hr	\<emph\>value\</emph\> is a number, a reference to a cell containing a number, or a formula which returns a number.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145629	16			0	hr	\<emph\>decimals\</emph\> is the optional number of decimal places.				20181231 09:50:43
