helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635	19			0	hr	DOLLAR(367.456;2) returns $367.46. Use the decimal separator that corresponds to the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>current locale setting\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
