helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	hr	Traces are displayed in the sheet with marking arrows. At the same time, the range of all the cells contained in the formula of the current cell is highlighted with a blue frame.				20181231 09:50:43
