helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098				0	hr	\<emph\>Return type\</emph\>: 1 for week beginning on a Sunday, 2 for week beginning on a Monday.				20181231 09:50:43
