helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149426				0	hr	A painting is bought on 1/15/1990 for 1 million and sold on 5/5/2002 for 2 million. The basis is daily balance calculation (basis = 3). What is the average annual level of interest?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151125				0	hr	=INTRATE("1/15/1990"; "5/5/2002"; 1000000; 2000000; 3) vraca 8.12%. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148654				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>COUPNCD function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
