helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149927				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_COUPNCD\"\>Returns the date of the first interest date after the settlement date. Format the result as a date.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
