helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150628				0	hr	Settlement: the date of purchase of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536				0	hr	Maturity: the date on which the security matures (expires).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	hr	Frequency: number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20181231 09:50:43
