helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154794				0	hr	A security is purchased on 1.25.2001; the date of maturity is 11.15.2001. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). Using daily balance interest calculation (basis 3) when is the next interest date?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3159251				0	hr	=COUPNCD("1.25.2001"; "11.15.2001"; 2; 3) vraća 5.15.2001.				20181231 09:50:43
