helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149339				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>IPMT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>periodic amortizement rates\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149339				0	hr	IPMT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154522				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZINSZ\"\>Calculates the periodic amortizement for an investment with regular payments and a constant interest rate.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153266				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151283				0	hr	IPMT(Rate;Period;NPER;PV;FV;Type)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147313				0	hr	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the periodic interest rate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145158				0	hr	\<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the period, for which the compound interest is calculated. Period=NPER if compound interest for the last period is calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147577				0	hr	\<emph\>NPER\</emph\> is the total number of periods, during which annuity is paid.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3156211				0	hr	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the present cash value in sequence of payments.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151213				0	hr	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) is the desired value (future value) at the end of the periods.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154195				0	hr	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the due date for the periodic payments.				20181231 09:50:43
