helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	hr	What is the interest rate during the fifth period (year) if the constant interest rate is 5% and the cash value is 15,000 currency units? The periodic payment is seven years.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150496				0	hr	IPMT(5%;5;7;15000) = -352.97 valutnih jedinica. Složena kamata tijekom petog razdoblja (godina) je 352.97 valutnih jedinica.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151205				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;future values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>future values;constant interest rates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>FV function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
