helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148638				0	hr	1000 currency units have been invested in for three years. The interest rates were 3%, 4% and 5% per annum. What is the value after three years?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3156358				0	hr	=FVSCHEDULE(1000; {0.03; 0.04; 0.05}) returns 1124.76.				20181231 09:50:43
