helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"Formula Bar\"\>Formula Bar\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InputLineVisible\"\>Shows or hides the Formula Bar, which is used for entering and editing formulas.\</ahelp\> The Formula Bar is the most important tool when working with spreadsheets.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	hr	To hide the Formula Bar, unmark the menu item.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	hr	If the Formula Bar is hidden, you can still edit cells by activating the edit mode with F2. After editing cells, accept the changes by pressing Enter, or discard entries by pressing Esc. Esc is also used to exit the edit mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Grupa				20181231 09:50:43
