helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151118				0	hr	\<variable id=\"funktionslistetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_FUNCTIONLIST\"\>This command opens the \<emph\>Function List\</emph\> window, which displays all functions that can be inserted into your document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The \<emph\>Function List\</emph\> window is similar to the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab page of the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"Function Wizard\"\>Function Wizard\</link\>. The functions are inserted with placeholders to be replaced with your own values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	hr	The \<emph\>Function List\</emph\> window is a resizable \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\>. Use it to quickly enter functions in the spreadsheet. By double-clicking an entry in the functions list, the respective function is directly inserted with all parameters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145799				0	hr	Popis kategorija				20181231 09:50:43
