helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148740				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WENN\"\>Specifies a logical test to be performed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153325				0	hr	Syntax				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558				0	hr	IF(Test; Then_value; Otherwise_value)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149727	52			0	hr	\<emph\>Test\</emph\> is any value or expression that can be TRUE or FALSE.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155828	53			0	hr	\<emph\>Then_value\</emph\> (optional) is the value that is returned if the logical test is TRUE.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811	54			0	hr	\<emph\>Otherwise_value\</emph\> (optional) is the value that is returned if the logical test is FALSE.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	hr	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149507				0	hr	Examples				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150867	57			0	hr	IF(A1>5;100;"too small") If the value in A1 is higher than 5, the value 100 is entered in the current cell; otherwise, \<emph\>too small\</emph\> is entered in text format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155954				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>NOT function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
