helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	hr	You can combine two or more 3D objects into a single object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150042				0	hr	To combine 3D objects:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	hr	Insert a 3D object from the \<emph\>3D Objects\</emph\> toolbar (for example, a cube).				20181231 09:50:43
