helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147167				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18130000.xhp\" name=\"Direct Cursor On/Off\"\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShadowCursor\"\>Activates or deactivates the direct cursor.\</ahelp\> You can specify the behavior of the direct cursor by choosing \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
