helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\03220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145412				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UnhainFrames\"\>Breaks the link between two frames.\</ahelp\> You can only break the link that extends from the selected frame to the target frame.				20181231 09:50:43
