helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147401				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ZoomIn\"\>Zooms out to see more of the document at a reduced size.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
