helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id8539384				0	hr	If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the following sentence from below the table will be deleted and the remainder of that paragraph will be moved into the last table cell. If an empty line follows the table, the empty line will be deleted.				20181231 09:50:43
