helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Inserting Page Numbers in Footers				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155624				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>footers; with page numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pages; numbers and count of\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page numbers; footers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering;pages\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155624				0	hr	\<variable id=\"footer_pagenumber\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footer_pagenumber.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Page Numbers in Footers\"\>Inserting Page Numbers in Footers\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id8230842				0	hr	You can easily insert a page number field in the footer of your document. You can also add a page count to the footer, for example, in the form "Page 9 of 12"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id7867366				0	hr	To Insert a Page Number				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Footer\</emph\> and select the page style that you want to add the footer to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3150534				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Number\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3153155				0	hr	If you want, you can align the Page Number field as you would text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id2988677				0	hr	To Additionally Add a Page Count				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	hr	Click in front of the Page Number field and type "Page ", click after the field, enter a space and then type "of ".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155554				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146875				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>headers; inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>footers; inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles; changing from selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>new page styles from selection\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146875				0	hr	\<variable id=\"change_header\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/change_header.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\"\>Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153584				0	hr	You can design a page layout and then create a page style based on it.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3154245				0	hr	For example, you can create a page style that displays a particular header, and another page style that displays a different header.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	hr	Open a new text document, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150532				0	hr	Click the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon and select \<emph\>New Styles from Selection\</emph\> from the submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	hr	Type a name for the page in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style name\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153184	32			0	hr	Double-click the name in the list to apply the style to the current page. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155541				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Header\</emph\>, and choose the new page style from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155572				0	hr	Type the text that you want in the header. Position the cursor into the main text area outside of the header.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155592				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147771				0	hr	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page break\</item\> and then select “Default” from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	hr	Repeat steps 2-6 to create a second custom \<emph\>Page Style\</emph\> with a different header.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Creating a Form Letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159257				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>form letters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>mail merge\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>letters; creating form letters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wizards;form letters\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159257				0	hr	\<variable id=\"form_letters\"\>\<variable id=\"form_letters_main\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/form_letters_main.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Form Letter\"\>Creating a Form Letter\</link\>\</variable\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	hr	To create a form letter, you need a text document that contains fields for address data, and an address database. Then you combine or merge the address data and the text document to either print the letters or send them by e-mail.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0805200801132382				0	hr	If the document is in HTML format, any embedded or linked images will not be sent with the e-mail.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10653				0	hr	The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge00.xhp\"\>Mail Merge Wizard\</link\> helps you to create form letters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10664				0	hr	To create a form letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066B				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Mail Merge Wizard\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10672				0	hr	You see the Mail Merge Wizard dialog. The following is an example of one of many possible ways to navigate the wizard's pages:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10676				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Start from a template\</emph\>, and click the \<emph\>Browse\</emph\> button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	hr	You see the Templates dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	hr	Select \<item type=\"literal\"\>Business Correspondence\</item\> in the left list, and then \<item type=\"literal\"\>Modern letter\</item\> in the right list. Click OK to close the Templates dialog, and click Next in the wizard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2669759				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Letter\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BD				0	hr	On the next step of the wizard, click the \<emph\>Select Address List\</emph\> button to check that you are using the correct address list. Select an address block type and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	hr	Next follows the \<emph\>Create a salutation\</emph\> step. Deselect the \<emph\>Insert personalized salutation\</emph\> box. Under \<emph\>General salutation\</emph\>, select the salutation that you want on top of all letters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\> on the following pages of the wizard. The pages are created, and you have the option to edit the created documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Animirani tekst				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151182				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>text animation\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>effects; text animation\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>animating text\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151182				0	hr	\<variable id=\"text_animation\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_animation.xhp\" name=\"Animating Text\"\>Animating Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145080				0	hr	You can only animate text that is contained in a drawing object, such as rectangles, lines, or text objects. For example, draw a rectangle, then double-click the rectangle and enter your text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	hr	Select the drawing object containing the text that you want to animate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Object - Text Attributes\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Animation\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819				0	hr	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Effect\</item\> box, select the animation that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	hr	Set the properties of the effect, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
