helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695				0	hr	\<variable id=\"number_sequence\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/number_sequence.xhp\" name=\"Defining Number Ranges\"\>Defining Number Ranges\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	hr	You can automatically number similar items, such as quotations, in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	hr	Type the text that you want to assign numbering to, for example, "Quotation Number ".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155048				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	hr	Click "Number range" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	hr	Type "Quotation" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3153387				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	hr	Type a number in the \<emph\>Value \</emph\>box, or leave the box empty to use automatic numbering.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3154851	58			0	hr	Select the outline level where you want the numbering to restart in the \<emph\>Level \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
