helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147833	2			0	hr	By default, $[officename] automatically corrects many common typing errors and applies formatting while you type. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081B				0	hr	To quickly undo an automatic correction or completion, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN10846				0	hr	To turn off most AutoFormat features, remove the check mark from the menu \<emph\>Format - AutoFormat - While Typing\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147251				0	hr	To remove a word from the AutoCorrect list:				20181231 09:50:43
