helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155863				0	hr	To delete a whole table, click in the table, and then choose \<emph\>Table - Delete - Table\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	hr	To delete the contents of a table, click in the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A until all cells are selected, and then press Delete or Backspace.				20181231 09:50:43
