helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autocorr_except.xhp	0	help	par_id3154254	11			0	hr	You can prevent AutoCorrect from correcting specific abbreviations or words that have mixed capital letters and lowercase letters. 				20181231 09:50:43
