helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3155923				0	hr	If you want to insert text before a table that is at the top of a page, click in the first cell of the table, in front of any contents of that cell, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Alt+Enter\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_idN10612				0	hr	To insert text after a table at the end of the document, go to the last cell of the table and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Alt+Enter\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
