helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	hr	To Apply a Background To Text Characters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	hr	Select the characters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
