helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	hr	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select the background color or a background graphic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id0104201010554939				0	hr	To select an object in the background, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key and click the object. Alternatively, use the Navigator to select the object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149294				0	hr	To Apply a Background To All or Part of a Table				20181231 09:50:43
