helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	hr	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select the background color or a background graphic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	hr	In the \<emph\>For\</emph\> box, choose whether the color or graphic should apply to the current cell, the current row or the whole table. If you select several cells or rows before opening the dialog, the change applies to the selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151041				0	hr	You may also use an icon to apply a background to table parts.				20181231 09:50:43
