helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136	15			0	hr	\<variable id=\"border_page\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/border_page.xhp\" name=\"Defining Borders for Pages\"\>Defining Borders for Pages\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	hr	In Writer, you can define borders for page styles, not individual pages. All changes made to borders apply to all pages that use the same page style. Note that page style changes cannot be undone by the Undo function in $[officename].				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150503				0	hr	Setting a Predefined Border Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Borders\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	hr	Select one of the default border styles in the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	hr	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	hr	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	hr	Setting a Customized Border Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Borders\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	hr	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	hr	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	hr	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	hr	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
