helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3145092				0	hr	You can remove the numbering from a paragraph in a numbered list or change the number that a numbered list starts with.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id2172612				0	hr	If you want numbered headings, use the \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\> menu command to assign a numbering to a paragraph style. Do not use the Numbering icon on the Formatting toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145107				0	hr	To remove the number from a paragraph in a numbered list:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3156248				0	hr	Click in front of the first character of the paragraph that you want to remove the numbering from.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153366				0	hr	Učinite nešto od navedenog:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153390				0	hr	To remove the number while preserving the indent of the paragraph, press the Backspace key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	hr	To remove the number and the indent of the paragraph, click the \<emph\>Numbering on/off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar. If you save the document in HTML format, a separate numbered list is created for the numbered paragraphs that follow the current paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154856				0	hr	To change the number that a numbered list starts with:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3155877				0	hr	Click anywhere in the numbered list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3148691	22			0	hr	Enter the number you want the list to start with in the \<emph\>Start at\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
