helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3156228				0	hr	You can create a conditional text field that displays the word "pages" instead of "page" in conjunction with a page count field if your document contains more than one page.				20181231 09:50:43
