helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Page Count\</emph\>, and then enter a space.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Other\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166				0	hr	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	hr	Type "Page > 1" in the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
