helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3151116				0	hr	Open the $[officename] Calc spreadsheet containing the cell range that you want to insert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150515				0	hr	In the spreadsheet, drag to select the cells.				20181231 09:50:43
