helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155919				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>running titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>floating titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>headers; chapter information\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>names; chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155919				0	hr	\<variable id=\"header_with_chapter\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_with_chapter.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\"\>Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	hr	Before you can insert chapter information into a header or footer, you must first set the outline numbering options for the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154244				0	hr	To create a paragraph style for chapter titles:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155874				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155898				0	hr	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles, for example, "Heading 1".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	hr	Select the numbering style for the chapter titles in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number\</item\> box, for example, "1,2,3...".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219				0	hr	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150245				0	hr	Enter a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>After\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150949				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150505				0	hr	To insert the chapter name and number in a header or a footer:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527				0	hr	Apply the paragraph style that you defined for chapter titles to the chapter headings in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153729				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Header\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Footer\</item\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153762				0	hr	Click in the header or footer.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Document\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153175				0	hr	Click "Chapter" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and "Chapter number and name" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147065				0	hr	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147095				0	hr	The header on every page that uses the current page style automatically displays the chapter name and number.				20181231 09:50:43
