helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149685				0	hr	Press the keys Alt+<underlined character> to open a menu. In an open menu, press the underlined character to run a command. For example, press Alt+I to open the \<emph\>Insert \</emph\>menu, and then T to insert a table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155186				0	hr	To open a context menu, press Shift+F10. To close a context menu, press Escape.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155918				0	hr	Umetanje Sekcija 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Insert\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155870				0	hr	Press F6 until the focus is on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	hr	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Section\</emph\> icon is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145100				0	hr	Press the down arrow key, and then press the right arrow key to set the width of the section that you want to insert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156237				0	hr	Press Enter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156253				0	hr	Press F6 to place the cursor inside the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153367				0	hr	Inserting Text Tables				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388				0	hr	Press F6 until the focus is on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Standard\</item\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154849				0	hr	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	hr	Press the down arrow key, and then use the arrow keys to select the number of columns and rows to include in the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	hr	Press Enter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072C				0	hr	Press F6 to place the cursor inside the document.				20181231 09:50:43
