helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155909				0	hr	To apply bold formatting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	hr	Select the text that you want to format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836	5			0	hr	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156112	6			0	hr	You can also press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B, type the text that you want to format in bold, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B when you are finished.				20181231 09:50:43
