helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	hr	The Navigator displays the different parts of your document, such as headings, tables, frames, objects, or hyperlinks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	hr	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	hr	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
