helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3148678				0	hr	Scrolls up one page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3148701				0	hr	Moves the cursor to the header.				20181231 09:50:43
