helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromdraw.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	hr	Hold down \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> and click and hold the object for a moment.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromdraw.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250				0	hr	Drag to the document where you want to insert the object.				20181231 09:50:43
