helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id6618243				0	hr	\<variable id=\"table_cellmerge\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_cellmerge.xhp\" name=\"Merging and Splitting Cells\"\>Merging and Splitting Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id1211890				0	hr	You can select adjacent cells, then merge them into a single cell. Conversely, you can take a large cell and divide it into individual cells.				20181231 09:50:43
