helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id5708792				0	hr	Select the adjacent cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id6301461				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Table - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id9156468				0	hr	Splitting Cells				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id3415936				0	hr	Place the cursor in the cell to be split.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id4044312				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Table - Split Cells\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id634174				0	hr	A dialog allows you to split the cell into two or more cells, horizontally or vertically.				20181231 09:50:43
