helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	hr	In Writer, you can define borders around OLE objects, plug-ins, diagrams/charts, graphics and frames. The name of the menu to be used depends on the object selected.				20181231 09:50:43
