helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	hr	If you want, you can format the table to behave as normal text. Insert the table into a frame, and then anchor the frame as a character. The frame remains anchored to the adjacent text when you insert or delete text.				20181231 09:50:43
