helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150101				0	hr	\<variable id=\"numbering_lines\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/numbering_lines.xhp\" name=\"Adding Line Numbers\"\>Adding Line Numbers\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842				0	hr	$[officename] can insert line numbers in an entire document or to selected paragraphs in your document. Line numbers are included when you print your document. You can specify the line numbering interval, the starting line number, and whether to count blank lines or lines in frames. You can also add a separator between line numbers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	hr	Line numbers are not available in HTML format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153410				0	hr	To add line numbers to an entire document:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Show numbering\</emph\>, and then select the options that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156241				0	hr	To add line numbers to specific paragraphs:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3156264				0	hr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153385				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Show numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	hr	Press F11 to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	hr	Right-click the "Default" paragraph style and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150222				0	hr	All paragraph styles are based on the "Default" style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	hr	Click the \<emph\>Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150956				0	hr	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line Numbering\</item\> area, clear the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</item\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150520				0	hr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151077				0	hr	Select the paragraph(s) where you want to add the line numbers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151096				0	hr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	hr	Select \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
