helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3146864				0	hr	You can also create a paragraph style that includes line numbering, and apply it to the paragraphs that you want to add line numbers to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146880				0	hr	To specify the starting line number:				20181231 09:50:43
