helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154100				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUMPARA\"\>Adds or removes numbering or bullets from the paragraph. You can also select the style of numbering to use, and reset the numbering in a numbered list.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536	14			0	hr	To change the numbering options for paragraphs that use the same paragraph style, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles \</emph\>icon. Right-click the style in the list, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline/Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	26			0	hr	To change the numbering options for selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline/Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
