helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151312				0	hr	Razdjelnik				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150350				0	hr	Paragraphs are separated by nonprinting paragraph marks. You can also specify that tabs or a character act as separators when you sort paragraphs.				20181231 09:50:43
