helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:TP_INSERT_SECTION:ED_RNAME\"\>Type a name for the new section.\</ahelp\> By default, $[officename] automatically assigns the name "Section X" to new sections, where X is a consecutive number.				20181231 09:50:43
