helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155903				0	hr	Previous link				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154192				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FRM_ADD_LB_PREV\"\>Displays the item (object, graphic, or frame) that comes before the current item in a linked sequence. To add or change the previous link, select a name from the list. If you are linking frames, the current frame and the target frame must be empty.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159198				0	hr	Sljedeća veza				20181231 09:50:43
