helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147512				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"AutoText\"\>AutoText\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571				0	hr	\<variable id=\"autotexttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditGlossary\"\>Creates, edits, or inserts AutoText. You can store formatted text, text with graphics, tables, and fields as AutoText. To quickly insert AutoText, type the shortcut for the AutoText in your document, and then press F3.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143277				0	hr	You can also click the arrow next to the \<emph\>AutoText\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> bar, and then choose the AutoText that you want to insert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148982				0	hr	AutoTekst				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153640	5			0	hr	The \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>dialog lists the AutoText categories and entries.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152766				0	hr	Display remainder of name as a suggestion while typing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145758				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_GLOSSARY:CB_INSERT_TIP\"\>Displays a suggestion for completing a word as a Help Tip after you type the first three letters of a word that matches an AutoText entry. To accept the suggestion, press Enter. If more than one AutoText entry matches the letters that you type, press Ctrl+Tab to advance through the entries.\</ahelp\> For example, to insert dummy text, type "Dum", and then press Enter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177	53			0	hr	To display the list in reverse order, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151378				0	hr	Ime				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155862	10			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_GLOSSARY:ED_NAME\"\>Lists the name of the currently selected AutoText entry. If you have selected text in the document, type the name of the new AutoText entry, click the \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>button, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150113				0	hr	Kratica				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147413				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_GLOSSARY:ED_SHORTNAME\"\>Displays the shortcut for the selected AutoText entry. If you are creating a new AutoText entry, type the shortcut that you want to use for the entry.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149558				0	hr	List box				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145257				0	hr	Lists the AutoText categories. To view the AutoText entries in a category, double-click the category, or click the plus sign (+) in front of the category. To insert an AutoText entry into the current document, select the entry in the list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153300				0	hr	You can drag and drop AutoText entries from one category to another.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156124				0	hr	Ubaci				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156094				0	hr	Inserts the selected AutoText into the current document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148788				0	hr	If you insert an unformatted AutoText entry into a paragraph, the entry is formatted with the current paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150039				0	hr	AutoTekst				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MENUBUTTON:DLG_GLOSSARY:PB_EDIT\"\>Click to display additional AutoText commands, for example, to create a new AutoText entry from a text selection in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154618				0	hr	Novi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_DEFINE\"\>Creates a new AutoText entry from the selection that you made in the current document. The entry is added to the currently selected AutoText category. You must first enter a name before you see this command.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149643				0	hr	Novo (samo tekst)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150668				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_DEFINE_TEXT\"\>Creates a new AutoText entry only from the text in the selection that you made in the current document. Graphics, tables and other objects are not included. You must first enter a name before you see this command.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154025				0	hr	Kopiraj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154043				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_COPY_TO_CLIPBOARD\"\>Copies the selected AutoText to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149965				0	hr	Zamijeni				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149607				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_REPLACE\"\>Replaces the contents of the selected AutoText entry with the selection that was made in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150768				0	hr	Preimenuj				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150786	24			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the Rename AutoText dialog, where you can change the name of the selected AutoText entry.\</ahelp\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120100.xhp\" name=\"Rename Text Block\"\>Rename AutoText\</link\> dialog, where you can change the name of the selected AutoText entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155341				0	hr	Uređivanje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155358				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_EDIT\"\>Opens the selected AutoText entry for editing in a separate document. Make the changes that you want, choose \<emph\>File - Save AutoText\</emph\>, and then choose \<emph\>File - Close\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
