helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154480				0	hr	1. ključ				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PRIM_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a subentry of the word that you enter here. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key, the index entry is "weather, cold".\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154572				0	hr	Drugi ključ				20181231 09:50:43
