helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151257				0	hr	Inserts the contents of the database field that you specify in the \<emph\>Record Number\</emph\> box as a mail merge field if the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"Condition\"\>\<emph\>Condition\</emph\>\</link\> that you enter is met. Only records selected by a multiple selection in the data source view are considered.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	hr	You can use this field to insert several records into a document. Simply insert the \<emph\>Any Record\</emph\> field in front of the form letter fields that use a certain record.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632				0	hr	Naziv baze podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	9			0	hr	Inserts the name of the database table selected in the \<emph\>Database selection \</emph\>box. The "Database Name" field is a global field, that is, if you insert a different database name in your document, the contents of all previously inserted "Database Name" fields are updated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	hr	Mail merge field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779				0	hr	Inserts the name of a database field as a placeholder, so that you can create a mail merge document. The field content is automatically inserted when you print the form letter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151372				0	hr	Sljedeći slog				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	hr	Inserts the contents of the next mail merge field in your document, if the condition that you define is met. The records that you want to include must be selected in the data source view.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	hr	You can use the "Next record" field to insert the contents of consecutive records between the mail merge fields in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	hr	Broj sloga				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147495				0	hr	Inserts the number of the selected database record.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149565				0	hr	Odabir baze podataka				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3145268				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DB_SELECTION_TLB\"\>Select the database table or the database query that you want the field to refer to.\</ahelp\> You can include fields from more than one database or query in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804391084				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>For fields linked to a condition, enter the criteria here.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147739				0	hr	If you want, you can assign a condition that must be met before the contents of the "Any Record" and "Next Record" fields are inserted. The default condition is "True", that is, the condition is always true if you do not change the condition text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146336				0	hr	Broj sloga				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_DB:ED_DBSETNUMBER\"\>Enter the number of the record that you want to insert when the condition that you specify is met.\</ahelp\> The record number corresponds to the current selection in the data source view. For example, if you select the last 5 records in a database containing 10 records, the number of the first record will be 1, and not 6.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3153305				0	hr	If you refer to fields in a different database (or in a different table or query within the same database), $[officename] determines the record number relative to the current selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156109				0	hr	Oblik				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3156122				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the format of the field that you want to insert. This option is available for numerical, boolean, date and time fields.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150904				0	hr	Iz baze				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150922				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FLD_DB:RB_DBOWNFORMAT\"\>Uses the format defined in the selected database.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076E				0	hr	Potraži				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10772				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"878711313\"\>Opens a file open dialog where you can select a database file (*.odb). The selected file is added to the Databases Selection list.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	hr	Definirano korisnikom				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3154333				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FLD_DB:RB_DBFORMAT\"\>Applies the format that you select in the \<emph\>List of user-defined formats\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146948				0	hr	List of user-defined formats				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150093				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DB:LB_DBFORMAT\"\>Lists the available user-defined formats.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FF				0	hr	Printing a form letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10803				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When you print a document that contains database fields, a dialog asks you if you want to print a form letter. If you answer Yes, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\"\>Mail Merge\</link\> dialog opens where you can select the database records to print.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10812				0	hr	Do not show warning again				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10816				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Suppresses this dialog from now on.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Styles in Writer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id4005249				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>styles;categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>character styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; styles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering;style categories\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150344				0	hr	Styles in Writer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	hr	The following information concerns Writer styles that you can apply using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	hr	If you want, you can edit the styles of the current document, and then save the document as a template. To save the document as template, choose \<emph\>File - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"Templates - Save\"\>\<emph\>Templates - Save\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150572				0	hr	Style Category				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153721				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:RID_STYLECATALOG:BT_TOOL\"\>These are the different categories of formatting styles.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
