helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153154				0	hr	Opis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	hr	Character Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	hr	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	hr	Paragraph Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	hr	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	hr	Stilovi okvira				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527				0	hr	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	hr	Page Styles 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	hr	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20181231 09:50:43
