helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249	2			0	hr	\<variable id=\"zeinum\"\>Adds or removes and formats line numbers in the current document. To exclude a paragraph from line numbering, click in the paragraph, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Numbering \</emph\>tab, and then clear the \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\> check box.\</variable\> You can also exclude a paragraph style from line numbering.				20181231 09:50:43
