helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156124				0	hr	Displays the condition that must be met for the field to be activated. If you want, you can enter a new \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156103				0	hr	Then, Else				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155073				0	hr	Change the field contents that are displayed depending on whether the field condition is met or not.				20181231 09:50:43
