helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148391				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_NUMERICFIELD_TP_DROPCAPS_FLD_LINES\"\>Enter the number of lines that you want the drop cap to extend downward from the first line of the paragraph. Shorter paragraphs will not get drop caps.\</ahelp\> The selection is limited to 2-9 lines.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	hr	Udaljenost od teksta				20181231 09:50:43
