helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146041				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FLD_INPUT\"\>Inserts a text field that you can open and edit by clicking it in the document.\</ahelp\> You can use input fields for text, or to assign a new value to a variable.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470				0	hr	To change the content of an Input Field in a document, click the field, and then edit the text in the lower box of the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153669				0	hr	Uređivanje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MULTILINEEDIT:DLG_FLD_INPUT:ED_EDIT\"\>The upper box displays the name that you entered in the \<emph\>Reference\</emph\> box of the Input Field on the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab of the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> dialog. The lower box displays the contents of the field.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155897				0	hr	Dalje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149691				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_FLD_INPUT:PB_NEXT\"\>Jumps to the next input field in the document.\</ahelp\> This button is only available when you position the cursor directly before an input field, and then press Shift+Ctrl+F9.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Reference				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153641				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"References\"\>References\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155142				0	hr	\<variable id=\"reftext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is where you insert the references or referenced fields into the current document. References are referenced fields within the same document or within sub-documents of a master document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	hr	The advantage of entering a cross-reference as a field is that you do not have to adjust the references manually every time you change the document. Just update the fields with F9 and the references in the document are updated too.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id4333628				0	hr	Type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id4516129				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the Selection list, and then click Insert.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3151380				0	hr	Tip				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150700				0	hr	Značenje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155862				0	hr	Postavi referencu				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	hr	Set target for a referenced field. Under \<emph\>Name\</emph\>, enter a name for the reference. When inserting the reference, the name will then appear as an identification in the list box \<emph\>Selection\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149556				0	hr	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For the target in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04040000.xhp\" name=\"insert a bookmark\"\>insert a bookmark\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150548				0	hr	Umetni referencu				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147746				0	hr	Inserting a reference to another position in the document. The corresponding text position has to be defined with "Set Reference" first. Otherwise, inserting a reference by choosing a field name under \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> is not possible.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146344				0	hr	In master documents, you can also reference from one sub-document to another. Note that the reference name will not appear in the selection field and has to be entered "by hand".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149847				0	hr	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For referenced fields in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020400.xhp\" name=\"insert a hyperlink\"\>insert a hyperlink\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id2408825				0	hr	Headings				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id9988402				0	hr	The Selection box shows a list of all headings in the order of their appearance in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6401257				0	hr	Numbered Paragraphs				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id5841242				0	hr	The Selection box shows a list of all numbered headings and numbered paragraphs in the order of their appearance in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id306711				0	hr	Bookmarks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150907				0	hr	After inserting a bookmark in the document with \<emph\>Insert - Bookmark\</emph\>, the bookmarks entry on the \<emph\>References\</emph\> tab becomes usable. Bookmarks are used to mark certain text passages in a document. In a text document, you can use the bookmarks, for example, to jump from one passage in the document to another.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155080				0	hr	In an HTML document, these bookmarks become anchors <A name>, which determine the target of hyperlinks for example.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200811011072				0	hr	Footnotes				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200811011049				0	hr	If your documents contains a footnote, you can select the Footnotes entry. A reference to a footnote returns the footnote number.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6794030				0	hr	(Inserted objects with captions)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id7096774				0	hr	You can set references to objects that have captions applied. For example, insert a picture, right-click the picture, choose Caption. Now the object shows up as a numbered "Illustration" in the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154772				0	hr	References are fields. To remove a reference, delete the field. If you set a longer text as a reference and you do not want to reenter it after deleting the reference, select the text and copy it to the clipboard. You can then reinsert it as "unformatted text" at the same position using the command \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>. The text remains intact while the reference is deleted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id5824152				0	hr	Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id7374187				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKSELECTION\"\>Lists the available fields for the field type selected in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list. To insert a field, click the field, select a format in the "Insert reference to" list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id7729728				0	hr	To quickly insert a field from the list, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and double-click the field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id2171086				0	hr	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, click the format that you want to use.				20181231 09:50:43
