helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175	2			0	hr	\<variable id=\"htmltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NewHtmlDoc\"\>Saves the file as an HTML document, so that you can view it in a web browser. You can choose to create a separate page when a heading style that you specify is encountered in the document.\</ahelp\> If you choose this option, a separate page of links to all of the pages that are generated is also created.\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149801				0	hr	Consecutive numbers are added to the file name if more than one HTML document is created. The titles of the HTML pages are created from the topmost chapter heading.				20181231 09:50:43
