helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_id7805413				0	hr	When you edit some records in a Calc spreadsheet data source that is currently in use for a mail merge, those changes are not visible in the mail merge.				20181231 09:50:43
