helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148572				0	hr	\<variable id=\"silben\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Hyphenate\"\>Inserts hyphens in words that are too long to fit at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> $[officename] searches the document and suggests hyphenation that you can accept or reject. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	hr	To automatically hyphenate the current or selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>Text Flow\</link\> tab. You can also apply automatic hyphenation to a paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151389				0	hr	When $[officename] finds a word that requires hyphenation, do one of the following options:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155622				0	hr	To accept the suggestion, click \<emph\>Hyphenate\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558				0	hr	To accept one of the suggestions, click the hyphen, type an Equal sign (=), and then click \<emph\>Hyphenate\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150017				0	hr	To reject the suggestion, click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150018				0	hr	To automatically hyphenate the remaining part of the selection or the document, click \<emph\>Hyphenate All\</emph\> and answer "Yes" to the following question.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150019				0	hr	To end hyphenation, click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>. The hyphenation that is applied already will not be reverted. You can use \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\> to undo all hyphenation that was applied while the Hyphenation dialog was open.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147562				0	hr	To exclude paragraphs from the automatic hyphenation, select the paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph, click the Text Flow\</emph\> tab, and then clear the \<emph\>Automatically\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Hyphenation \</emph\>area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154276				0	hr	To turn off the suggestion dialogs for hyphenation, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Language Settings - Writing Aids\"\>Tools - Options - Language Settings - Writing Aids\</link\>, and select the \<emph\>Hyphenate without inquiry\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152950				0	hr	To manually enter a hyphen, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign (-).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147523				0	hr	To insert a non-breaking (protected) hyphen, click in the word that you want to hyphenate, and then press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign(-).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154573				0	hr	To hide custom hyphens, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>, and then clear the \<emph\>Custom hyphens\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150360				0	hr	Word				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153676				0	hr	Word				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149687				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:ED_WORD\"\>Displays the hyphenation suggestion(s) for the selected word.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154195				0	hr	Left / Right Arrow				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155174				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_RIGHT\"\>Set the position of the hyphen. This option is only available if more than one hyphenation suggestion is displayed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151327				0	hr	Dalje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149306				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_HYPH_CONTINUE\"\>Ignores the hyphenation suggestion and finds the next word to hyphenate.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149495				0	hr	Rastavi riječi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPHENATE\"\>Inserts the hyphen at the indicated position.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154829				0	hr	Ukloni				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_HYPH_DELETE\"\>Rejects the hyphenation suggestion.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects and frames\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving and resizing with keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resizing;objects and frames, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	hr	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248				0	hr	You can resize and move selected frames and objects with the keyboard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	hr	To move a selected frame or object, press an arrow key. To move by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150762				0	hr	To resize a selected frame or object, first press Ctrl+Tab. Now one of the handles blinks to show that it is selected. TO select another handle, press Ctrl+Tab again. Press an arrow key to resize the object by one grid unit. To resize by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	hr	The increment by which you move an object with the keyboard is determined by the document grid. To change the properties of the document grid, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text document - Grid\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05120300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Odabir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154660				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05120300.xhp\" name=\"Select\"\>Select\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EntireColumn\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Selects the column that contains the cursor.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if the cursor is in a table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	Primijeni				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	bm_id5028839				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>automatic heading formatting\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	bm_id				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>AutoFormat function;headings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>headings;automatic\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>separator lines;AutoFormat function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155962				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150200.xhp\" name=\"Apply\"\>Apply\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871	2			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoFormatApply\"\>Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147404				0	hr	When you apply automatic formats, the following rules apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	hr	AutoFormat for Headings				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505				0	hr	A paragraph is formatted as a heading when the following conditions are met:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	hr	paragraph begins with a capital letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	hr	paragraph does not end with a punctuation mark				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	hr	empty paragraph above and below the paragraph				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	hr	AutoFormat for Bullets / Numbering				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	hr	To create a bulleted list, type a hyphen (-), star (*), or plus sign (+), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763	18			0	hr	To create a numbered list, type a number followed by a period (.), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147507				0	hr	Automatic numbering is only applied to paragraphs formatted with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\>, \<emph\>Text body\</emph\> or \<emph\>Text body indent\</emph\> paragraph styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	hr	AutoFormat for Separator Lines				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	hr	If you type three or more hyphens (---), underscores (___) or equal signs (===) on line and then press Enter, the paragraph is replaced by a horizontal line as wide as the page. The line is actually the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"lower border\"\>lower border\</link\> of the preceding paragraph. The following rules apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	hr	Three hyphens (-) yield a single line (0.05 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	hr	Three underscore (_) yield a single line (1 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982				0	hr	Three equal signs (=) yield a double line (1.10 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	SamoOblikovanje				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153925				0	hr	\<bookmark_value\>AutoFormat function; text documents\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153925				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150000.xhp\" name=\"AutoFormat\"\>AutoFormat\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151182	2			0	hr	Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - AutoCorrect\"\>\<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id1029200810080924				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040000.xhp\"\>AutoCorrect Options\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id1029200810080924				0	hr	Opens the AutoCorrect dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	hr	To open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150101.xhp\" name=\"AutoFormat for Tables\"\>AutoFormat for Tables\</link\> dialog, click in a table cell, and then choose \<emph\>Table - AutoFormat\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
