helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149880				0	hr	An inserted script is indicated by a small green rectangle. If you do not see the rectangle, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - HTML Document\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"View\"\>\<emph\>View\</emph\>\</link\>, and select the \<emph\>Notes \</emph\>check box. To edit a script, double-click the green rectangle.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150572				0	hr	If your document contains more than one script, the \<emph\>Edit Script\</emph\> dialog contains previous and next buttons to jump from script to script.				20181231 09:50:43
