helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Prevents the contents of the selected cells from being modified.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154641				0	hr	When the cursor is in a read-only cell, a note appears on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292				0	hr	To remove cell protection, select the cell(s), and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cell - Remove Protection\"\>\<emph\>Format - Cell - Remove Protection\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
