helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	hr	\<variable id=\"bereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditRegion\"\>Changes the properties of sections defined in your document.\</ahelp\> To insert a section, select text or click in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275				0	hr	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, and offers the following additional options:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149820				0	hr	Odsječak				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149104	5			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Type the name of the section that you want to edit, or click a name in the \<emph\>Section \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\> If the cursor is currently in a section, the section name is displayed on the right side of the status bar at the bottom of the document window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	hr	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638				0	hr	Odrednice				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behavior of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password protected, you must enter the password first.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155143				0	hr	Remove				20181231 09:50:43
