helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149287				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Ruler\"\>Ruler\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ruler\"\>Shows or hides the horizontal ruler, that you can use to adjust page margins, tab stops, indents, borders, table cells, and to arrange objects on the page.\</ahelp\> To show the vertical ruler, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - View\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select the \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	hr	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp#ruler\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hr	While  Typing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436	1			0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150100.xhp\" name=\"While  Typing\"\>While Typing\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	2			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OnlineAutoFormat\"\>Automatically formats the document while you type. To set the formatting options, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>tab.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	hr	You can use AutoFormat to format text documents and plain ASCII text files, but not characters that you have manually formatted. Automatic \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"word completion\"\>word completion\</link\> only occurs after you type a word for the second time in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147407				0	hr	To reverse the last AutoFormat action, choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02010000.xhp\" name=\"Undo\"\>\<emph\>Undo\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	hr	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150200.xhp\" name=\"Other AutoFormat rules\"\>Other AutoFormat rules\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
