helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147169				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the level that you want to define.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147569				0	hr	Structure and formatting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	hr	The \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line displays the table of contents code for the selected heading level. To change the appearance of a heading level you can enter codes or text in the empty boxes on this line. You can also click in an empty box or on a code, and then click a code button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292	35			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the remainder of the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	8			0	hr	To delete a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Delete\</item\> key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	9			0	hr	To replace a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then click a code button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480	10			0	hr	To add a code to the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click in an empty box, and then click a code button. The following codes are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153675				0	hr	Chapter number (E#)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567	12			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_ENTRYNO\"\>Inserts the complete chapter heading, including, if available, the chapter number. To assign chapter numbering to a heading style, choose\<emph\> Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149691				0	hr	Entry text (E)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154199				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_ENTRY\"\>Inserts the text of the chapter heading.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143276				0	hr	Tab stop (T)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490	16			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_TAB\"\>Inserts a tab stop. To add leader dots to the tab stop, select a character in the \<emph\>Fill character box\</emph\>. To change the position of the tab stop, enter a value in the \<emph\>Tab stop position \</emph\>box, or select the \<emph\>Align right \</emph\>check box.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151257				0	hr	Page number (#)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3148981				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_PAGENO\"\>Inserts the page number of the entry.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147212				0	hr	 Hyperlink (LS and LE)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631	20			0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_HYPERLINK\"\>Creates a hyperlink for the part of the entry that you enclose by the opening (LS) and the closing (LE) hyperlink tags. On the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click in the empty box in front of the part that you want to create a hyperlink for, and then click this button. Click in the empty box after the part that you want to hyperlink, and then click this button again. All hyperlinks must be unique.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152766				0	hr	Sve				20181231 09:50:43
