helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	hr	\<variable id=\"spaltentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_COLUMN\"\>Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for a page style, frame, or section.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	hr	Osnovne postavke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149352				0	hr	You can select from predefined column layouts, or create your own. When you apply a layout to a page style, all pages that use the style are updated. Similarly, when you apply a column layout to a frame style, all frames that use that style are updated. You can also change the column layout for a single frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154562				0	hr	Stupci				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154508				0	hr	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_NUMERICFIELD_TP_COLUMN_ED_NUMBER\"\>Enter the number of columns that you want in the page, frame, or section.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149884				0	hr	You can also select one of the predefined column layouts.				20181231 09:50:43
