helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148860				0	hr	The commands offered in the Styles and Formatting window are the same as those found in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"Style Catalog\"\>\<emph\>Style Catalog\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
